window.EXAUD={"Please accept this small gift from our class.": "audio/cau/86e7a0b4e2454140.mp3", "Lan accepted the invitation, but Minh refused it.": "audio/cau/ac6f7b1f73f4208f.mp3", "Work in pairs and act out the dialogue.": "audio/cau/9f80b4a8118b33e2.mp3", "We must act quickly to save water.": "audio/cau/2f2b0156a6f07db9.mp3", "We need to take action to keep our school clean.": "audio/cau/0c8076052760d1f1.mp3", "Lan is very active, and her quick action helped her friend.": "audio/cau/aa0ee4199314c27b.mp3", "My little brother is very active.": "audio/cau/ee888778c322e79a.mp3", "Hoa is active and enjoys every club activity.": "audio/cau/a7bbb816806174db.mp3", "She actively takes part in class.": "audio/cau/3744bd9a9d414fa7.mp3", "We actively help clean the beach.": "audio/cau/886d6508a571df0e.mp3", "We do many fun activities at the weekend.": "audio/cau/996d76bf4c31cea3.mp3", "Mi is very active and loves outdoor activities.": "audio/cau/94fea0819039eaa4.mp3", "Swimming is my favourite activity.": "audio/cau/f1504092a266a13a.mp3", "Hoa is an active girl, and dancing is her best activity.": "audio/cau/3d7dcf03c6c96451.mp3", "'Kind' is an adjective that describes people.": "audio/cau/e79678700752e8de.mp3", "Find one adjective in this sentence: Lan is clever.": "audio/cau/543a075275273447.mp3", "Kind and friendly are adjectives.": "audio/cau/571da65dd4451319.mp3", "Find two adjectives in each sentence.": "audio/cau/e83a6ada9ad972af.mp3", "Tickets are 50,000 dong for adults.": "audio/cau/acb3b6176262fa6b.mp3", "Children must swim with an adult.": "audio/cau/3a59f4c818a8fe7c.mp3", "Teenagers are moving into adulthood.": "audio/cau/013e9b2c200496e0.mp3", "He kept this habit into adulthood.": "audio/cau/b68f97019ccb106d.mp3", "Hoa is always polite when she talks to adults.": "audio/cau/30f664238e37dbc6.mp3", "Adults need about eight hours of sleep.": "audio/cau/965ef8331141619a.mp3", "I agree with you about the park.": "audio/cau/f2a726fc02481cb5.mp3", "Nam agrees with the plan, but Mi disagrees.": "audio/cau/15f7b23e7c7063cd.mp3", "We reached an agreement after the talk.": "audio/cau/1544b408c62fc15c.mp3", "She nodded in agreement.": "audio/cau/4c9349a25fbbf77c.mp3", "The two sisters look alike.": "audio/cau/adc5d16e3a95923c.mp3", "No two people are exactly alike.": "audio/cau/bd46ef9712c752ec.mp3", "Lan likes music. She also likes drawing.": "audio/cau/a42927a6760bdc56.mp3", "Nam speaks English and also learns Japanese.": "audio/cau/d657bddc45a35d0d.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "Please answer the teacher's question.": "audio/cau/f790ccdd60f40ece.mp3", "Nam asks and Hoa answers.": "audio/cau/128cffcafde831b9.mp3", "Check your answers with a partner.": "audio/cau/8656910f569b2925.mp3", "Lan can answer all the questions, and her answers are correct.": "audio/cau/df2a478d26596242.mp3", "The sun appeared after the rain.": "audio/cau/720885e25ae366ec.mp3", "Stars appear at night.": "audio/cau/c5d17a416347cd40.mp3", "Describe your best friend's appearance.": "audio/cau/fd6bc3447c428dd2.mp3", "Minh's appearance changed, but his smile did not disappear.": "audio/cau/895a7b39715b47bf.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "I had an argument with my sister.": "audio/cau/3985d243607d6392.mp3", "His argument is very strong.": "audio/cau/fabb8432f3f23996.mp3", "You can ask your teacher for help.": "audio/cau/675c99f05fae3d5e.mp3", "Phong asked a question, and Mi answered it.": "audio/cau/ad374096f949206b.mp3", "The shop assistant is very friendly.": "audio/cau/a154f19326268e60.mp3", "My phone has a voice assistant.": "audio/cau/4c4e5412c0038e10.mp3", "Who is the author of this book?": "audio/cau/307f149b72d48019.mp3", "To Hoai is a famous author.": "audio/cau/e04eb4b941758460.mp3", "Steve Jobs passed away in 2011.": "audio/cau/be8b92331608f7f3.mp3", "My school is 2 km away from my house.": "audio/cau/36a79be5031eac35.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "Eating too much sugar is bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/385b55508b3849c3.mp3", "The traffic was bad today, but yesterday it was worse.": "audio/cau/4db5861a9ee30736.mp3", "The city was badly affected by the flood.": "audio/cau/1e256308778b183a.mp3", "Nam played badly today, but yesterday he played worse.": "audio/cau/c2078c45e0d95aa8.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "It's sunny. Let's go to the beach.": "audio/cau/270a764075ddb193.mp3", "My Khe Beach in Da Nang is very beautiful.": "audio/cau/c42618aa030cc85a.mp3", "Our lessons begin at seven o'clock.": "audio/cau/7e2700abcf553879.mp3", "The film began at 8 p.m. and finished at 10 p.m.": "audio/cau/27d24f5e96b08bae.mp3", "Lan is my best friend.": "audio/cau/9edc7bdf247f31c3.mp3", "Mi's drawing is good, Nam's is better, but Hoa's is the best.": "audio/cau/c2336133ff2dce7f.mp3", "Life in the city is better for me.": "audio/cau/1aaaaca243bd56b5.mp3", "Lan's drawing is good, Mi's is better, and Hoa's is the best.": "audio/cau/eb8986ba6f0ca74b.mp3", "Our school has a big garden.": "audio/cau/6b86817f41024790.mp3", "My house is big, but Minh's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/1d7d2b8d19284673.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is bigger than Da Nang.": "audio/cau/5efe9fe286047142.mp3", "My house is big, but Nam's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/44f8b6366001f6da.mp3", "This is the biggest market in the city.": "audio/cau/ba6358ef44b7b295.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is the biggest city in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/815c69dda42327e1.mp3", "Fill in each blank with one word.": "audio/cau/0b238b46fd929b2f.mp3", "Write the correct answer in the blank.": "audio/cau/8d62e86f859c14ce.mp3", "Complete the blanks with the correct words.": "audio/cau/5278bb1298c4aa56.mp3", "There are five blanks, so fill each blank carefully.": "audio/cau/2e0163444ee11c94.mp3", "Mi is wearing a blue dress.": "audio/cau/992073792364c614.mp3", "The sky is blue, and the sea is dark blue.": "audio/cau/46190d72fcbbb528.mp3", "Long speeches bore me.": "audio/cau/8caeb0926b488ee3.mp3", "I don't want to bore you with details.": "audio/cau/0053023504c797f2.mp3", "I'm bored. Let's go out.": "audio/cau/349dce422beb0ca4.mp3", "She gets bored with the same games.": "audio/cau/5538b000e1d9a2cc.mp3", "Reading helps me fight boredom.": "audio/cau/50e83619a7ea3b82.mp3", "He played games out of boredom.": "audio/cau/d68f7ca31f034697.mp3", "The film was long and boring.": "audio/cau/2fb37c98bad76a4f.mp3", "The lesson was boring, so Nam felt bored.": "audio/cau/0b9b11807d964d8b.mp3", "There is a cat in the box.": "audio/cau/2e85eeb9526b3b0e.mp3", "Put the toys in the box; we have three boxes.": "audio/cau/94612872a7e7c8fc.mp3", "The toys are in the boxes.": "audio/cau/170d9e1f4536be5e.mp3", "Mai puts her books in two boxes.": "audio/cau/895f5119e1e2f239.mp3", "The boy next to Mi is my brother.": "audio/cau/2b8e169ba1253282.mp3", "There are ten boys and twelve girls in my class.": "audio/cau/f109fb5b9db06caa.mp3", "My dad told me about his boyhood.": "audio/cau/07bbaf2f97aea1c8.mp3", "This is his boyhood home.": "audio/cau/290020f85e6dc306.mp3", "The boys are playing football in the yard.": "audio/cau/a14f1aea2e9181df.mp3", "One boy is reading, and the other boys are drawing.": "audio/cau/4ae5ad7c214a1d49.mp3", "Use the words in brackets.": "audio/cau/496e7371ea0c5719.mp3", "Put the verb in the bracket in the correct form.": "audio/cau/dab9456e755cf63f.mp3", "Put the verbs in brackets in the correct form.": "audio/cau/db94e0ded7cf0ad1.mp3", "Write the word in brackets, like this: (go).": "audio/cau/35267fe98d59e0cc.mp3", "We play games at break time.": "audio/cau/d7be6e5b8ac32945.mp3", "Be careful not to break the cup; Nam broke one yesterday.": "audio/cau/cb188b00dfe78e80.mp3", "Hoa is a bright student.": "audio/cau/505049821b13285a.mp3", "The sun shines brightly on a bright morning.": "audio/cau/8688428d91bd1a20.mp3", "Please bring your English book tomorrow.": "audio/cau/cd49561735d6690b.mp3", "Exams can bring about a lot of stress.": "audio/cau/4bcd1f108e558b55.mp3", "My bike is broken.": "audio/cau/b25995551405e15b.mp3", "Be careful with the broken glass.": "audio/cau/67b6f7828c3ee823.mp3", "Her family runs a small business in Hue.": "audio/cau/5535eee598660a8f.mp3", "He started a business and now he is a businessman.": "audio/cau/0fd271a26ee50825.mp3", "My uncle is a successful businessman.": "audio/cau/f0ac2a2960c3b45f.mp3", "Many businessmen and businesswomen came to the meeting.": "audio/cau/843f693ed8691d3e.mp3", "My aunt is a successful businesswoman.": "audio/cau/969a25840998f6db.mp3", "The businesswoman travels a lot.": "audio/cau/72e3e47ef97bff41.mp3", "My mum is always busy at weekends.": "audio/cau/e860f8923617b0aa.mp3", "Hoa is busy today, but she is free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/1d5a0a62fb11072c.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "Can you help me carry this box?": "audio/cau/a0f121aef5c03fe7.mp3", "Lan carried her books, and today she carries her bag.": "audio/cau/e736c67580379245.mp3", "There is a fan on the ceiling.": "audio/cau/189ba54f3c765bee.mp3", "The ceiling is white, and the floor is brown.": "audio/cau/4dfa3c577c1469c3.mp3", "My little brother grew five centimetres this year.": "audio/cau/7cee213af81ca0c6.mp3", "The box is twenty centimetres wide.": "audio/cau/0e66b04f9513e6b8.mp3", "I often chat with my neighbours.": "audio/cau/f9bdc10e4250f241.mp3", "Mi and Lan had a long chat after school.": "audio/cau/92771962baaa6db3.mp3", "My sister is very chatty.": "audio/cau/276b5f54d77e4429.mp3", "The chatty boy has many friends.": "audio/cau/40b44064047e81db.mp3", "Bus tickets are cheap in my city.": "audio/cau/03544a8cd417b99f.mp3", "This bike is cheaper than that expensive one.": "audio/cau/e0b002a616298d3f.mp3", "This shirt is cheaper than that one.": "audio/cau/2fb5e5af26848879.mp3", "Food at the market is cheaper.": "audio/cau/21368e59cd125059.mp3", "This is the cheapest bike in the shop.": "audio/cau/c9b3edafd0c21611.mp3", "The bus is the cheapest way to travel.": "audio/cau/0b549f6a33bccebd.mp3", "You can eat cheaply at street stalls.": "audio/cau/dfea060d3a66f8ee.mp3", "We travelled cheaply by bus.": "audio/cau/c965f95b5b8607df.mp3", "Every child in the village goes to school.": "audio/cau/9f966cc92f3b2d70.mp3", "When he was a child, he lived with his grandparents.": "audio/cau/5f1982ddb057760f.mp3", "I had a happy childhood in the countryside.": "audio/cau/29493d8d0469345f.mp3", "This song reminds me of my childhood.": "audio/cau/a5f0b56f6286f10d.mp3", "Don't be childish; say sorry.": "audio/cau/3e2e6a125ca40003.mp3", "That is a childish game.": "audio/cau/acd7fb585862d0ca.mp3", "She has three children and two grandchildren.": "audio/cau/41e17d5597e264f0.mp3", "One child was quiet, but the other children were noisy.": "audio/cau/863bff50c6e9f303.mp3", "You have a choice of tea or juice.": "audio/cau/d83c640d99d55e18.mp3", "I think you made a good choice.": "audio/cau/89c0a3eddbcb6efd.mp3", "Choose the correct answer.": "audio/cau/9bb3b69b3f099527.mp3", "Mi chose a red pen. It was a good choice.": "audio/cau/4fabb83c5ec962f5.mp3", "I help my mum with the chores.": "audio/cau/ec58d4ed18c9c760.mp3", "Doing chores is my duty at weekends.": "audio/cau/09249f9d1a1fd9c1.mp3", "I chose the bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/9c85ffa2fb7223db.mp3", "You can choose one, and Nam chose the red one.": "audio/cau/3684e06d8810f79f.mp3", "She was chosen as class monitor.": "audio/cau/77ca45b3c93c0c06.mp3", "Have you chosen a book yet?": "audio/cau/69586b45796a6e5b.mp3", "Speak with clarity so everyone understands.": "audio/cau/b17e50f6d06efaa6.mp3", "The photo has great clarity.": "audio/cau/d8eaeaca6ddb4a4f.mp3", "There are forty students in my class.": "audio/cau/69f347ac209b4fc2.mp3", "Nam is my classmate. We are in the same class.": "audio/cau/e6a0aa2aaff4be27.mp3", "Our school has twenty classes.": "audio/cau/c3a891dc027e3741.mp3", "We have English classes on Monday.": "audio/cau/cd49a2bc4c3e1c86.mp3", "Nam is my new classmate.": "audio/cau/8f038868644223fc.mp3", "My classmate and I sit in the same classroom.": "audio/cau/ebc5ea3d6e23a8ba.mp3", "Our classroom is on the second floor.": "audio/cau/c460b559d453bdeb.mp3", "My classmates and I clean the classroom on Fridays.": "audio/cau/9cf5ce52e3da16c8.mp3", "Thanks to garbage collectors, our streets are clean.": "audio/cau/daef4e3fa0819a5e.mp3", "We clean the streets every weekend.": "audio/cau/d0801c735785b87e.mp3", "The cleaner works early in the morning.": "audio/cau/2d62413dec6c90b6.mp3", "The street cleaner cleans the road every day.": "audio/cau/e156ac2a11c8608f.mp3", "Her goal in life was very clear.": "audio/cau/0960d8382dfe4e74.mp3", "The teacher's voice is clear, so we hear her clearly.": "audio/cau/f8c8cb276c506e09.mp3", "Please speak clearly and slowly.": "audio/cau/bd9b0aafe2596459.mp3", "The sign is clear, so we can read it clearly.": "audio/cau/424ef8e97612359a.mp3", "Minh is a clever boy.": "audio/cau/620f8c5f3017a282.mp3", "Lan is clever. She answers the questions cleverly.": "audio/cau/2720a9ae3428f690.mp3", "She answered the question cleverly.": "audio/cau/b127f7ca5556eeca.mp3", "The robot is cleverly designed.": "audio/cau/78c94fc4362f7380.mp3", "Everyone praised his cleverness.": "audio/cau/8a333324f6d5417b.mp3", "The fox is known for its cleverness.": "audio/cau/165b55f081837120.mp3", "There is a clock on the wall.": "audio/cau/db00df18f8f94a24.mp3", "Nam has a watch, but his room has no clock.": "audio/cau/93f2ef3a8ab5efe7.mp3", "This bag is made of cloth.": "audio/cau/7733aaa3678ed9a6.mp3", "Clean the table with a wet cloth.": "audio/cau/9de57f8b2cc33a0d.mp3", "This shop sells traditional clothes.": "audio/cau/f9f8fc01958edcec.mp3", "These clothes are made from silk cloth.": "audio/cau/19f3df33d3f79b2d.mp3", "Bring warm clothing for the trip.": "audio/cau/cabe691534654654.mp3", "This shop sells children's clothing.": "audio/cau/1bba2a627a5e83ee.mp3", "The pencil is 15 cm long.": "audio/cau/9f3be1039db1c201.mp3", "I am 150 cm tall.": "audio/cau/ebf91635575b1372.mp3", "I came down with a cold last week.": "audio/cau/6589d8d2056f15e9.mp3", "It is cold in Ha Noi in winter.": "audio/cau/6af5e5587fe6cf7a.mp3", "It is colder in Hà Nội than in Huế.": "audio/cau/b237ef8ec896eeff.mp3", "Today is colder than yesterday.": "audio/cau/409448c6fcb45c6b.mp3", "January is the coldest month.": "audio/cau/ebe4d008920b3287.mp3", "Sa Pa is one of the coldest places in Việt Nam.": "audio/cau/8864f62bbf1c3b12.mp3", "I can feel the coldness of the water.": "audio/cau/23d48b220795c5bf.mp3", "Her coldness made him sad.": "audio/cau/681563c4a0ca6a61.mp3", "What colour is her hair?": "audio/cau/e7aa61d42982634f.mp3", "My favourite colour is blue, and my room is colourful.": "audio/cau/65b041dfbe52909f.mp3", "My bedroom has colourful walls.": "audio/cau/5480caf95b688723.mp3", "Each colour is bright, so the picture is colourful.": "audio/cau/c94ba14044838a90.mp3", "The vases come in many colours.": "audio/cau/94d8b0e3f46f47ec.mp3", "These lanterns are colourful with many colours.": "audio/cau/25365bbf6a69ac23.mp3", "We communicate with friends by email.": "audio/cau/71c0cac04361b2eb.mp3", "Good communication helps us communicate better.": "audio/cau/83b537bc6eb88878.mp3", "Communication is important in a team.": "audio/cau/ceae7194d8982d8f.mp3", "We communicate in English to improve our communication skills.": "audio/cau/78dbdceb83728ae8.mp3", "She is a communicative student.": "audio/cau/c7fbc92e73c9d5a0.mp3", "Be communicative with your classmates.": "audio/cau/dde8f897fd3f06c4.mp3", "She works for a computer company.": "audio/cau/dbaa7b1a7f381505.mp3", "His company is now a big business.": "audio/cau/8c1460aeda0ca27f.mp3", "The comparative of 'big' is 'bigger'.": "audio/cau/4e28e78ae9e0c458.mp3", "We compare two cities using the comparative.": "audio/cau/928477415d139668.mp3", "Compare your answers with your partner.": "audio/cau/f8be7b0e308e141f.mp3", "Let's compare the two pictures and find the differences.": "audio/cau/d1518af4c2a94436.mp3", "Make a comparison between city and country life.": "audio/cau/4eb51db2fe33ea37.mp3", "We learn comparison of adjectives.": "audio/cau/02353122847ea89a.mp3", "Ten teams will compete in the contest.": "audio/cau/bc2bc9c6eaf3a909.mp3", "Shops compete to get more customers.": "audio/cau/8e6a5d427025d93c.mp3", "Our class won the singing competition.": "audio/cau/50866e1f598cc16b.mp3", "Ten schools will compete in the competition.": "audio/cau/06281553525951dd.mp3", "My brother is very competitive.": "audio/cau/27bc999339be3f4e.mp3", "Football is a competitive sport.": "audio/cau/338b017284616edd.mp3", "Each competitor has three minutes.": "audio/cau/f49ca20c752358d7.mp3", "He is a strong competitor.": "audio/cau/ee643344680b459e.mp3", "Complete the sentences with the words.": "audio/cau/a10abe8427f587a5.mp3", "Mi completed her homework. Now it is complete.": "audio/cau/e89d49e3a54806e8.mp3", "Lan completely forgot her friend's birthday.": "audio/cau/ae968fd2ecb01b87.mp3", "Minh completely forgot about his homework.": "audio/cau/4ec9cda7a9209eb1.mp3", "Nam plans his time well to ensure timely completion of his project.": "audio/cau/dc9f46bca5bd24cf.mp3", "After the completion of the test, Hoa felt relaxed.": "audio/cau/8159d955f47b0ba3.mp3", "The old house is in bad condition.": "audio/cau/9d9ffa685f510da3.mp3", "You can go out on one condition.": "audio/cau/7b86edfe13e3aa0b.mp3", "Lan won the drawing contest.": "audio/cau/39fb5410a09b8c99.mp3", "Each contestant in the contest made a craft.": "audio/cau/986663616ad674f1.mp3", "Each contestant must answer five questions.": "audio/cau/4826d8d69bb66f57.mp3", "The youngest contestant is ten years old.": "audio/cau/9970a3f14aafc68d.mp3", "Pictures can convey feelings.": "audio/cau/b45023c10ff5cb69.mp3", "He conveyed the message to the class.": "audio/cau/b99a3ce158152ab0.mp3", "Choose the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/6f45c31e9ee537be.mp3", "Nam's answer is correct, but mine is wrong.": "audio/cau/2f88ef38a2385ee5.mp3", "The teacher made corrections in red.": "audio/cau/895634813fdf81d2.mp3", "Check your corrections carefully.": "audio/cau/c829f7ab4f978d5b.mp3", "Try to say these new words correctly.": "audio/cau/d4da04af4337ec0f.mp3", "Her answer is correct because she read the question correctly.": "audio/cau/cee1de65a2a9d88f.mp3", "Travelling abroad is costly.": "audio/cau/3ecac6693c9b43a2.mp3", "The mistake was costly.": "audio/cau/02e469afe966b2c2.mp3", "Lan creates a to-do list every Sunday evening.": "audio/cau/87a26e3235a8f368.mp3", "Our class created a poster about healthy living.": "audio/cau/97dc8c8a67b315e5.mp3", "This dish is the chef's own creation.": "audio/cau/fc920ec6ff357284.mp3", "The creation of the park took two years.": "audio/cau/e03b9893206b7583.mp3", "Hoa is very creative in art class.": "audio/cau/d1a85d15ebb2ea7b.mp3", "Nam is creative. He likes to create new games.": "audio/cau/a92d851d2aed43a0.mp3", "Think creatively to solve the problem.": "audio/cau/1a17aa75cda6d112.mp3", "She decorated the room creatively.": "audio/cau/f9ce37c34e63c1d1.mp3", "Art lessons help students show their creativity.": "audio/cau/ef2eb572bc331261.mp3", "Phong is creative, and his creativity makes our class fun.": "audio/cau/c91d4b0dff266adb.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "My dad is a doctor.": "audio/cau/87de43de098d8ab6.mp3", "My dad cooks dinner, and my mum washes the dishes.": "audio/cau/8ca0dad82745ad96.mp3", "Daddy, can you read me a story?": "audio/cau/7b9c274b06183fb5.mp3", "My daddy works in a hospital.": "audio/cau/7cb12862406fc83e.mp3", "Traffic jams are part of daily life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c95ad670d219bd23.mp3", "Nam reads the news daily, every day before school.": "audio/cau/7ddb05aad387c96a.mp3", "Mi and Hoa dance at the school party.": "audio/cau/356e0201b5187306.mp3", "My sister is a good dancer and loves to dance.": "audio/cau/e8fb6f50a3a6c011.mp3", "My sister wants to be a dancer.": "audio/cau/5d46a6b73d07af2c.mp3", "The dancer moved beautifully.": "audio/cau/fb89c401a2209ac5.mp3", "The girls are dancing in the yard.": "audio/cau/aa0c810aa58f1c78.mp3", "Nam likes dancing, and he dances well.": "audio/cau/c4264938bcc20b39.mp3", "It is dark outside now.": "audio/cau/48eaca11c1014cbe.mp3", "Minh's room is dark, so he turns on the light.": "audio/cau/8c6105f992faba73.mp3", "The sky darkened before the storm.": "audio/cau/d9787ddc931beccb.mp3", "Darken the room to watch the film.": "audio/cau/8dcb0bff5658ca38.mp3", "The cat can see in the darkness.": "audio/cau/4ab111dd152c0904.mp3", "The room was in complete darkness.": "audio/cau/76f9e637b0656b52.mp3", "I have English every day.": "audio/cau/50a9802d88a8dbc0.mp3", "Nam studies by day and sleeps at night.": "audio/cau/0f498730d8ee8697.mp3", "There are seven days in a week.": "audio/cau/4193126d14e614a3.mp3", "I study English daily, even on busy days.": "audio/cau/f6f890f7b3bda2bf.mp3", "I can't decide which book to buy.": "audio/cau/47ca2b793880dcb6.mp3", "Hoa made a decision: she decided to join the art club.": "audio/cau/28af8310e23fd584.mp3", "It was a hard decision.": "audio/cau/b8d94f5eb3006ee1.mp3", "You need to make a decision now.": "audio/cau/91b8d7a20820fa7d.mp3", "A good captain must be decisive.": "audio/cau/4e34f9e0a33a9144.mp3", "That goal was decisive.": "audio/cau/5cd061b07f39fa1d.mp3", "Hoa's mother cooks delicious pho.": "audio/cau/8a832f4b8fdda704.mp3", "If I have all the ingredients, I can make a delicious pizza.": "audio/cau/5f9d8db4e0198b83.mp3", "The soup smells deliciously sweet.": "audio/cau/ce26057ccb6626e4.mp3", "The cake was deliciously soft.": "audio/cau/8e60b2e1af17c654.mp3", "The Sahara is the largest hot desert.": "audio/cau/b5ab545ec1917b35.mp3", "Camels can live in the desert.": "audio/cau/c06453c4acef7e3c.mp3", "She wants to design clothes when she grows up.": "audio/cau/73e28be0aedd98a0.mp3", "Hoa is a designer; she designs school uniforms.": "audio/cau/654b4ba1f4bbceb2.mp3", "She wants to be a fashion designer.": "audio/cau/7eb916336ea71b61.mp3", "The designer made a new logo.": "audio/cau/d5d68202fffded5a.mp3", "The fire destroyed the old house.": "audio/cau/36cb28d95071f932.mp3", "Pollution destroys the environment.": "audio/cau/b351f0817a25406e.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "My house is different from yours.": "audio/cau/5abda8894fc87510.mp3", "Lan and Mi are different; the difference is their hobbies.": "audio/cau/fd7e006914631783.mp3", "Maths is difficult for me.": "audio/cau/16bb57fb47e5df02.mp3", "This test is difficult, but that one is easy.": "audio/cau/56b22511f0d64b7c.mp3", "I have difficulty in pronouncing this word.": "audio/cau/f0983c29e5893490.mp3", "She solved the problem without difficulty.": "audio/cau/0c8af826fc6c33c1.mp3", "We dine out on Saturday nights.": "audio/cau/d6ee4bf6d95e5514.mp3", "Would you like to dine with us?": "audio/cau/a8d51146b2ed57a2.mp3", "The diners enjoyed the food.": "audio/cau/d13e2e37559aca31.mp3", "We had breakfast at a small diner.": "audio/cau/bf7d056b70387029.mp3", "We have dinner in the dining room.": "audio/cau/0da06a41959332b5.mp3", "My family dines together at the big dining table.": "audio/cau/9d8c37b02490203e.mp3", "We have dinner at seven o'clock.": "audio/cau/77dd1a87a5f4dc45.mp3", "Mum cooks dinner, and we eat in the dining room.": "audio/cau/0a14a0a831731a66.mp3", "There is dirt on your shoes.": "audio/cau/d360a0d04782b35c.mp3", "The dirt from the building site makes the street dirty.": "audio/cau/43a785de1e1d3309.mp3", "The air in big cities is dirty.": "audio/cau/286767588a10e6b5.mp3", "Wash your dirty hands to remove the dirt.": "audio/cau/400fb6184b406956.mp3", "I disagree with your idea.": "audio/cau/7cce19c50dd76b38.mp3", "Nam agrees, but Lan disagrees with him.": "audio/cau/c54e8ccfbafa7323.mp3", "They had a disagreement about the trip.": "audio/cau/f1d5a16d4f41e479.mp3", "We sometimes disagree, but each disagreement is small.": "audio/cau/9bbbf8d89f966fd1.mp3", "The sun disappeared behind the clouds.": "audio/cau/11fe510042a50c97.mp3", "Many animals may disappear forever.": "audio/cau/521cb2c0bd5d4075.mp3", "The disappearance of the forest is sad.": "audio/cau/a955560c619a520c.mp3", "Police are looking into his disappearance.": "audio/cau/3d686321342cae6f.mp3", "The rubbish smells disgusting.": "audio/cau/015d96847b18791d.mp3", "Throwing litter is a disgusting habit.": "audio/cau/70c280acb8be7883.mp3", "Pho is a famous dish in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/424a388ba5580cf4.mp3", "After dinner, Nam washes every dish and puts it away.": "audio/cau/781ac60b40e0a0f4.mp3", "I help my mum wash the dishes.": "audio/cau/83a3a811fa9e1d28.mp3", "The dishwasher washes the dishes.": "audio/cau/e4f1b813a976fc5d.mp3", "We have a dishwasher in our kitchen.": "audio/cau/46b58b3ebfb64e79.mp3", "The dishwasher washes every dish quickly.": "audio/cau/504f99665a51075b.mp3", "I dislike noisy and crowded places.": "audio/cau/5ace2bb2616bf75c.mp3", "Mi likes cats, but she dislikes dogs.": "audio/cau/a21ccd81f7c8d400.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "Mi doesn't like milk very much.": "audio/cau/63a58b0dc618ef2d.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but Minh doesn't do it.": "audio/cau/362bb11ca0696388.mp3", "What are you doing now?": "audio/cau/cc6dbef7715013a7.mp3", "Lan is doing her homework, and she did the maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/c6619d790ec63e61.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "Can you draw a cat?": "audio/cau/be2932fbc93e80e5.mp3", "Hoa drew a flower and gave me the drawing.": "audio/cau/8ef26c64079b1115.mp3", "Lan's drawing is on the wall.": "audio/cau/e1c99913c9bb1dcf.mp3", "Minh draws well. He drew this drawing yesterday.": "audio/cau/a06a821e60587e14.mp3", "Have you drawn a picture of your family?": "audio/cau/a0d1c0f1a36ef4c7.mp3", "This map was drawn by my brother.": "audio/cau/eaf88a36f69101ec.mp3", "My brother draws pictures of animals.": "audio/cau/f72f002c0ce9c3b5.mp3", "Mi draws every day, and last week she drew a horse.": "audio/cau/c53f78fbfbf3ff78.mp3", "He drew a cat on the board.": "audio/cau/60aeb1a679f13bef.mp3", "We drew pictures in the art lesson.": "audio/cau/cffb3f0aaad7fa4f.mp3", "Life in the countryside can be dull for some teens.": "audio/cau/0347cee2d305ff73.mp3", "The film was dull, but the book was exciting.": "audio/cau/8b56307431aca227.mp3", "Do exercise e on page ten.": "audio/cau/f397a6a2157f10ba.mp3", "The word 'eye' starts with the letter e.": "audio/cau/5f2132c30b4b4b2f.mp3", "She answered the questions with ease.": "audio/cau/1ed3583b60bd53b0.mp3", "I feel at ease with my friends.": "audio/cau/fec10720b6d9bead.mp3", "Mi makes friends easily at school.": "audio/cau/eedb13c811943ed4.mp3", "The test was easy, so I finished it easily.": "audio/cau/7cb7e2c3342cf293.mp3", "This English exercise is very easy.": "audio/cau/708befc5d340e6e4.mp3", "This question is easy, but that one is difficult.": "audio/cau/6ec1dbc0277d41ef.mp3", "Happiness is a good emotion.": "audio/cau/85242f9f388820d1.mp3", "He sang with a lot of emotion.": "audio/cau/c2425938ce8cd326.mp3", "Teenagers often have strong emotions.": "audio/cau/2a1729b8c1aefa77.mp3", "Emojis show our emotions in messages.": "audio/cau/11be9e14c1ca4732.mp3", "Parents encourage children to read books.": "audio/cau/e023715e37fdca1c.mp3", "My teacher's encouragement makes me want to try harder.": "audio/cau/0c43bb2e98cce98e.mp3", "At the end of the story, he became a hero.": "audio/cau/4cef74a2fd4fb11a.mp3", "We read to the end, and the ending was happy.": "audio/cau/fc827bfa0e26aa94.mp3", "Our PE teacher is very energetic.": "audio/cau/0f20bc2cdf1fdbbc.mp3", "I feel energetic after a good sleep.": "audio/cau/38346e6197dce33e.mp3", "I enjoy living in the city.": "audio/cau/1cc10e53aebeec12.mp3", "We enjoy the trip because it is very enjoyable.": "audio/cau/1a682a8a24ff63b3.mp3", "We had an enjoyable trip to Da Lat.": "audio/cau/fa0dde7e848371c0.mp3", "The English lesson was enjoyable.": "audio/cau/339769385e39a593.mp3", "Reading gives me a lot of enjoyment.": "audio/cau/baba1a4ac12d7cb6.mp3", "He plays the guitar for enjoyment.": "audio/cau/1ffb1fdae1d623a4.mp3", "Can you enlarge this photo?": "audio/cau/f7ea9d85d2ae68b7.mp3", "They plan to enlarge the school library.": "audio/cau/98d58917fdd12ccd.mp3", "The clown entertained the children.": "audio/cau/f769feda914ea794.mp3", "Music can entertain people of all ages.": "audio/cau/f5204e9c4d91bbb9.mp3", "The game show is very entertaining.": "audio/cau/0a77eddbcf1dbdaa.mp3", "He told us an entertaining story.": "audio/cau/28ed28e19b8b89ae.mp3", "Cities offer lots of entertainment.": "audio/cau/63cf66848c4eb0b8.mp3", "The show entertains children, so it is good entertainment.": "audio/cau/2e7c63c4052fabc6.mp3", "I spent the entire day at home.": "audio/cau/edb66e800ba6c4c2.mp3", "The entire class went on the trip.": "audio/cau/f92c63bf4d359ad1.mp3", "We need pens, books, rulers, etc.": "audio/cau/98b59178a016ed12.mp3", "I like many sports: football, swimming, cycling, etc.": "audio/cau/ce119ac48c4fa7cd.mp3", "He even worked at night to help his family.": "audio/cau/35c426a9236c1cc0.mp3", "It is cold here, even in summer.": "audio/cau/65983b86a05b922c.mp3", "I do my homework in the evening.": "audio/cau/4615eb9cc8fbce85.mp3", "Good evening! We have dinner every evening at seven.": "audio/cau/737b0c650458cf41.mp3", "Cooking is an everyday activity for my mum.": "audio/cau/03801a514b91f476.mp3", "We use everyday English every day at school.": "audio/cau/61f0eab70fe5dd6e.mp3", "City life is exciting for teens.": "audio/cau/28945e456a70e4ca.mp3", "The trip was exciting, so we were very excited.": "audio/cau/53c60dbfd0e789cf.mp3", "Food is our biggest expense.": "audio/cau/25abb079ec0a7e72.mp3", "The school paid the expense of the trip.": "audio/cau/0af9eb98ee27b49b.mp3", "Houses in the city are expensive.": "audio/cau/53d09ce3370d8fca.mp3", "This bag is expensive, but that one is cheap.": "audio/cau/d708d9a2b5676f1d.mp3", "Modal verbs express ability, permission or advice.": "audio/cau/9c1f08aacb3d36af.mp3", "Mai uses a drawing to express her feelings.": "audio/cau/e43ecbb0d592515d.mp3", "\"Break a leg\" is an English expression.": "audio/cau/03d61dde951cfe19.mp3", "Her facial expression showed she was sad.": "audio/cau/ce988b82d9baac3c.mp3", "Learn these useful expressions by heart.": "audio/cau/f77071b27c197d14.mp3", "Use expressions to show surprise.": "audio/cau/349580710e59c8ae.mp3", "She has very expressive eyes.": "audio/cau/2bd85d8e4e55b758.mp3", "He read the poem in an expressive voice.": "audio/cau/e3044d8bcefa667f.mp3", "Look at the audience and make eye contact.": "audio/cau/c4b16bbbce49770b.mp3", "Lan has big eyes and long black hair.": "audio/cau/15209ecb4d490c7b.mp3", "Mi has big black eyes.": "audio/cau/2dc803b2e1e6b728.mp3", "Close your eyes and touch your left eye.": "audio/cau/11b06c9c51e8a07e.mp3", "Wash your face before breakfast.": "audio/cau/b40392145a1b9e72.mp3", "Hoa has a round face, and we draw funny faces.": "audio/cau/bed7bfe736a05e74.mp3", "The children have happy faces.": "audio/cau/326d20380efdc287.mp3", "Phong has an oval face. Look at our faces in the photo.": "audio/cau/f76c0b6fc6a16fb9.mp3", "His facial expression showed he was angry.": "audio/cau/7d1a424cbbfd0671.mp3", "Emojis copy our facial expressions.": "audio/cau/2ec8636c8fa6f1d7.mp3", "We went to the book fair on Sunday.": "audio/cau/3ffcbaf506dd881c.mp3", "It's not fair to cheat in a test.": "audio/cau/945f8b31052e1278.mp3", "The singer found fame at a young age.": "audio/cau/38e4c711b20f4bb0.mp3", "Money and fame don't bring happiness.": "audio/cau/f2341314eb013e00.mp3", "Hoi An is famous for its lanterns.": "audio/cau/be0831db3c3bf621.mp3", "General Giap became famous, and his fame spread worldwide.": "audio/cau/4eabd5e77fd10a06.mp3", "My father is a doctor in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/ad3b88cec9d38c40.mp3", "Hoa's father and grandfather are both farmers.": "audio/cau/86e9c9df994f954c.mp3", "I feel happy when I am with my friends.": "audio/cau/347c7145dbd3848c.mp3", "Nam felt tired after the long trip.": "audio/cau/722683185c73007a.mp3", "I have a good feeling about the test.": "audio/cau/fe5f18ce79a79a07.mp3", "Hoa felt proud; it was a wonderful feeling.": "audio/cau/f6b8ed872b819448.mp3", "It's good to talk about your feelings.": "audio/cau/cdf20fc753a5fb3b.mp3", "Mi feels sad, so please don't hurt her feelings.": "audio/cau/cda439cffd4f26f2.mp3", "Fill in the gaps with the correct words.": "audio/cau/fdb1b1c53693f72e.mp3", "Mi fills the glass, and now it is full.": "audio/cau/ebdf9cc5c316901a.mp3", "I finish my homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/4c12023029931700.mp3", "Hoa started the project in May and finished it in June.": "audio/cau/92423d5fe3d5c777.mp3", "Use the past simple for finished events.": "audio/cau/15e768d53722862d.mp3", "We finished our visual story yesterday.": "audio/cau/da44bbf9abdec66f.mp3", "This bed is too firm for me.": "audio/cau/064e0f85120f1c46.mp3", "My uncle works for a big firm.": "audio/cau/268c7a26eae8f672.mp3", "My dad can fix my bike.": "audio/cau/380a96233420152d.mp3", "Robots can fix machines.": "audio/cau/62d12ab2ac12c60e.mp3", "Our flight to Ha Noi was two hours.": "audio/cau/edd55810c00c32e8.mp3", "Have a nice flight!": "audio/cau/b19cd25ff952b594.mp3", "Minh lives on the fifth floor.": "audio/cau/17f068310aaa9769.mp3", "Mi's town house has three floors.": "audio/cau/049f5e6113f37c5d.mp3", "My bedroom is on the second floor.": "audio/cau/58f076886cf1907b.mp3", "An eagle can fly very high.": "audio/cau/dfdf4f8e37f30b09.mp3", "The birds fly over the rice fields.": "audio/cau/f73eb4cc01d5056f.mp3", "We made a flyer for the school fair.": "audio/cau/424d8860946967b3.mp3", "A man gave me a flyer in the street.": "audio/cau/61b40de231f1ef5f.mp3", "Follow the steps to make your poster.": "audio/cau/6579733e7f4abc4a.mp3", "Minh followed his teacher's advice and passed the exam.": "audio/cau/9fff6306c664e2d9.mp3", "She has a thousand followers online.": "audio/cau/23024d95c73edb6e.mp3", "He is a follower of the football team.": "audio/cau/d212f1f4123de65f.mp3", "Answer the following questions.": "audio/cau/7a648aa7c194b903.mp3", "We followed the plan the following day.": "audio/cau/f2e1b58551411942.mp3", "We need food and water every day.": "audio/cau/01b6dc39aa643a2b.mp3", "Mum feeds the baby healthy food.": "audio/cau/1407b84140607171.mp3", "Write the correct form of the verb.": "audio/cau/704fc6fb85cc3f27.mp3", "'Going' is the -ing form of 'go'.": "audio/cau/8b6c34b2f8dd653a.mp3", "The cave has amazing rock formations.": "audio/cau/044cef15503b6f02.mp3", "We learnt about the formation of rain.": "audio/cau/69ef9163d5895073.mp3", "Why are you frowning?": "audio/cau/c3c089e0d351f4ed.mp3", "The teacher was frowning at the noisy boys.": "audio/cau/83df786346cd03db.mp3", "I eat fruit every day.": "audio/cau/6471baf4645a9651.mp3", "Fresh fruit like mangoes and bananas is healthy.": "audio/cau/7c63484ea41b9637.mp3", "Viet Nam has many tropical fruits.": "audio/cau/555e63190e77ea6e.mp3", "Mangoes are my favourite fruit.": "audio/cau/539c08d26d25750d.mp3", "Write short notes, not full sentences.": "audio/cau/14bb97e16bb6d06a.mp3", "The bus was full, but the next one was empty.": "audio/cau/cfd981c78ac3d787.mp3", "After a good sleep, Lan is fully alert in class.": "audio/cau/e731cef6fdf5dd54.mp3", "Minh hasn't fully recovered from his cold.": "audio/cau/8cd54850c26f30ee.mp3", "We have fun at the summer camp.": "audio/cau/042795d03f276893.mp3", "The game was fun, and Nam's jokes were funny.": "audio/cau/1343a6a406625409.mp3", "My uncle is very funny.": "audio/cau/3365f3c2b0a43869.mp3", "Phong is funny, so playing with him is fun.": "audio/cau/754492bd17fda5cf.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "Fill in each gap with a word from the box.": "audio/cau/afa644b720499eae.mp3", "Read the sentence, then fill the gap with the right word.": "audio/cau/1c138053d1f45bdd.mp3", "My grandmother has a small garden.": "audio/cau/ad0b9ba5604dc0f5.mp3", "Grandpa loves gardening, so our garden is beautiful.": "audio/cau/2afdcb2a5601fa6f.mp3", "The gardener waters the flowers every day.": "audio/cau/22a67e0a027f6f3e.mp3", "My grandpa is a good gardener.": "audio/cau/ab1e7c940217b2ba.mp3", "My grandpa enjoys gardening in his free time.": "audio/cau/fcd49413f27e2295.mp3", "Gardening is fun, and our garden looks beautiful.": "audio/cau/59d0b9e54bc0416e.mp3", "My friend gave me a book for my birthday.": "audio/cau/301ff487a1615458.mp3", "Lan gives gifts to friends; last year she gave me a pen.": "audio/cau/759dbf022fa0c89a.mp3", "The girl in the red dress is my sister.": "audio/cau/5c0a090c7edf82c5.mp3", "There are fifteen girls and twenty boys in my class.": "audio/cau/6f902e1712b320f2.mp3", "The girls are playing badminton.": "audio/cau/52ee8ca04fd9a936.mp3", "One girl wears glasses, and the other girls don't.": "audio/cau/b79f88c94a17e5cf.mp3", "Please give me your notebook.": "audio/cau/63fd3e27b3248933.mp3", "Hoa gives her mum flowers; yesterday she gave her a card.": "audio/cau/8a999a2635280ba0.mp3", "Lan finishes her project within the given time.": "audio/cau/e0a4a7e575000b77.mp3", "Our teacher has given us three tasks this week.": "audio/cau/cd0bbafcb1fa540b.mp3", "I'm glad to see you again.": "audio/cau/2142ed8602d3048a.mp3", "She was glad about her good marks.": "audio/cau/d16fb4cab4382d01.mp3", "I go to school by bike.": "audio/cau/df5dcef1ab40916f.mp3", "We often go to the beach; last summer we went to Nha Trang.": "audio/cau/9dac5f396b6a209e.mp3", "Mum has gone to the market.": "audio/cau/85901dafd6c6e677.mp3", "The rain has gone.": "audio/cau/42856535a7f42416.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "My goodness! It's so hot today.": "audio/cau/262b2c15cb0e80ce.mp3", "She helped us out of goodness.": "audio/cau/68406886afe46623.mp3", "My grandfather is 75 years old.": "audio/cau/aaac8af2aea80407.mp3", "My grandfather and grandmother live in Hue.": "audio/cau/a198eed6e615b9c6.mp3", "Grandpa is reading the newspaper.": "audio/cau/d2d844236b1f3b5a.mp3", "Grandpa is my mum's father, and he is very kind.": "audio/cau/5f39a7c7669e2379.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside.": "audio/cau/14d9858e971da542.mp3", "Minh visits his grandparents; his grandfather has a farm.": "audio/cau/ff809b7d116e870e.mp3", "I'm grateful to my teachers.": "audio/cau/215960298d6eb11b.mp3", "We are grateful for your help.": "audio/cau/7f07b88037eb59e0.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "We need more green spaces in the city.": "audio/cau/7e358d9d053e2d45.mp3", "Our city is green, and it is getting greener.": "audio/cau/a9cfdf8c1935609c.mp3", "The city needs more greenery.": "audio/cau/28806f8937a6b84d.mp3", "I love the greenery of the countryside.": "audio/cau/b063a42fdc893563.mp3", "Elephants are grey.": "audio/cau/cce38c3f47d4bd5f.mp3", "The sky is grey today.": "audio/cau/d0e63f83669f58a5.mp3", "Each group has four members.": "audio/cau/6db9bb96270db26c.mp3", "Work in groups and report your group's findings.": "audio/cau/dd390edb36c261a2.mp3", "The teacher puts us into groups of five.": "audio/cau/ec8808da410c34e5.mp3", "Our class has six groups, and each group has six students.": "audio/cau/0f693c5a4478ab4f.mp3", "You have grown so tall!": "audio/cau/5aabe598d360154d.mp3", "These apples are grown in Japan.": "audio/cau/17d912f1cd44cf22.mp3", "Guards protect the palace.": "audio/cau/08f8cabeb13a29cb.mp3", "The guards check our tickets.": "audio/cau/7ad9393c16a0157b.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "My mother has long black hair.": "audio/cau/41b2fceab317cdd9.mp3", "Phong's hair is short because he had a haircut.": "audio/cau/63f3438257726452.mp3", "I need a haircut.": "audio/cau/7d93abbd1c7b72f7.mp3", "Do you like my new haircut?": "audio/cau/f47102da0cfc35d6.mp3", "My aunt is a hairdresser.": "audio/cau/08be3cd9c8f14bf9.mp3", "I go to the hairdresser's once a month.": "audio/cau/a2858025cc239abe.mp3", "My dog has long, hairy ears.": "audio/cau/041d7835247f9da0.mp3", "The spider has hairy legs.": "audio/cau/f2a919f0ec51fd15.mp3", "It was the happiest day of my life.": "audio/cau/6048467774b371d1.mp3", "Nam is the happiest boy in our class.": "audio/cau/b5233b9378eb9841.mp3", "The children are playing happily in the yard.": "audio/cau/16909a238549ea96.mp3", "She smiled happily at her teacher.": "audio/cau/4b9815868c8e0707.mp3", "Good health brings happiness.": "audio/cau/d40ad946903ff046.mp3", "Her face was full of happiness.": "audio/cau/cf704e43df3396fb.mp3", "I am happy to see my friends again.": "audio/cau/29fdd3b9f6ed1e66.mp3", "Mi smiles happily because she is happy.": "audio/cau/feee63efb252ba2b.mp3", "The maths test was very hard.": "audio/cau/0fd61471858155e3.mp3", "Minh works hard; he is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/32c549e4a9f6fc13.mp3", "I could hardly hear the teacher.": "audio/cau/144fb5f35860f6c9.mp3", "He hardly ever eats vegetables.": "audio/cau/2dbec027597d3ff1.mp3", "Lan is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/5b3ff11d5293f4e5.mp3", "Nam is hardworking, and he never gets lazy.": "audio/cau/06cd2484f9437f49.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I hate waiting for the bus in the rain.": "audio/cau/3f99a8ce5b4ab56c.mp3", "Nam likes city life, but he hates traffic jams.": "audio/cau/6300158d6a0d3117.mp3", "We should not answer hatred with hatred.": "audio/cau/cb3de93e19e75388.mp3", "Hatred can hurt friendships.": "audio/cau/014fc79ff92a660d.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "We are having lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/68be2432f9d1c150.mp3", "Lan is having fun because she has many friends here.": "audio/cau/955a8fc5bad8bd17.mp3", "We turn on the heater in winter.": "audio/cau/97b6d2a218e566ca.mp3", "The water heater is broken.": "audio/cau/3923709391d2f3ac.mp3", "It rained heavily last night.": "audio/cau/1a3ae2881e3af6a8.mp3", "The city is heavily polluted.": "audio/cau/30feb15789eaf8ce.mp3", "I felt a heaviness in my legs after the run.": "audio/cau/93a252fa650203da.mp3", "The heaviness of the box surprised me.": "audio/cau/41712f1b0642aa07.mp3", "This box is too heavy for me.": "audio/cau/ac63962a8602519b.mp3", "Heavy rain causes floods, and the traffic gets heavier.": "audio/cau/7da989b969861a4f.mp3", "My height is one metre fifty.": "audio/cau/6ed0620c69bbaf2a.mp3", "The tower is very high; its height is 100 metres.": "audio/cau/3baba19856abae04.mp3", "The campaign heightens awareness of pollution.": "audio/cau/56be7ae049bd5030.mp3", "Music can heighten your mood.": "audio/cau/6b33e5d565f0fa6e.mp3", "Can you help me with my homework?": "audio/cau/59064ec1f34486d3.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she always helps her mum cook.": "audio/cau/82b6e08d58022ab1.mp3", "A street cleaner is a community helper.": "audio/cau/4e5627311f32688c.mp3", "The helper always helps old people cross the road.": "audio/cau/5d453af4870fad09.mp3", "The map is very helpful for tourists.": "audio/cau/01dfa6b6d0d2dc96.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she often helps her neighbours.": "audio/cau/28366edc55c3b71c.mp3", "The shop assistant answered helpfully.": "audio/cau/0b65805c79b864c9.mp3", "She helpfully showed me the way.": "audio/cau/5386979ac33e124d.mp3", "A newborn baby is helpless.": "audio/cau/63bf6644f9f61f8a.mp3", "I felt helpless when I got lost.": "audio/cau/848d3008d4aae72b.mp3", "My bedroom is here, next to the kitchen.": "audio/cau/38f5476965ee13ae.mp3", "Come here, Nam! Your bag is over there.": "audio/cau/1518838d605d3769.mp3", "The cat hid under the bed.": "audio/cau/298f285710fac644.mp3", "I hid the present in my bag.": "audio/cau/07440e0df31ca254.mp3", "Let's play hide-and-seek!": "audio/cau/92bdf95ba8e2006c.mp3", "Where did you hide the key?": "audio/cau/353d0b3791179764.mp3", "The sky train runs high above the ground.": "audio/cau/8dbedccf6d7409b7.mp3", "Birds fly high in the sky.": "audio/cau/b0c96ceb3c271f43.mp3", "Everest is the highest mountain in the world.": "audio/cau/c52c583d53977b9a.mp3", "She got the highest mark in the test.": "audio/cau/be76ed2a2a659650.mp3", "This book is highly interesting.": "audio/cau/009ba70280cc0bc3.mp3", "I highly recommend this film.": "audio/cau/da2440ac003a9db6.mp3", "I go home at five o'clock.": "audio/cau/a74ab800c921a80b.mp3", "After school, Mi does her homework at home.": "audio/cau/ecaf6456acc0b85d.mp3", "I felt homesick on my first day at camp.": "audio/cau/4d3a402933ae59e2.mp3", "Students studying abroad often feel homesick.": "audio/cau/ea48648e9a7d5f77.mp3", "Nam does his homework at home every evening.": "audio/cau/0c529025b7e7c4aa.mp3", "In the hot sun, he is always at the school gate.": "audio/cau/d94f7911dc61672f.mp3", "The heat is terrible today; it's so hot!": "audio/cau/15a129bda3aabffd.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is hotter than Ha Noi in winter.": "audio/cau/88067063f0f080f3.mp3", "July is hot, but this week is even hotter.": "audio/cau/665ec33e8beb3794.mp3", "July is the hottest month of the year here.": "audio/cau/fe0ba3253dbf0bf9.mp3", "Today is hot, but tomorrow will be the hottest day.": "audio/cau/49fb3f5586c59a2b.mp3", "Our house is near the river.": "audio/cau/462620c6e9d42610.mp3", "Lan's house is big, so the housework takes a long time.": "audio/cau/ffae3b516fc16794.mp3", "Lan helps her mother with the housework.": "audio/cau/603758dd29202743.mp3", "I do housework at weekends, like cleaning the house.": "audio/cau/603861c40de6e77e.mp3", "He was poor. However, he never gave up.": "audio/cau/893555bad2aff789.mp3", "It rained. However, Nam still went to school, but late.": "audio/cau/97115d20f691f7e4.mp3", "My teacher is very humorous.": "audio/cau/8f6ba9ed4e3a796d.mp3", "I read a humorous story yesterday.": "audio/cau/d81d0caf2c1c6edb.mp3", "Watching TV all day makes you inactive.": "audio/cau/41590c23ceb7a257.mp3", "The volcano has been inactive for years.": "audio/cau/6cfc968444b1c2e9.mp3", "Your homework is incomplete.": "audio/cau/1def1df8007e7413.mp3", "Complete the incomplete sentences.": "audio/cau/865265a2ff56d7b1.mp3", "Correct the incorrect sentences.": "audio/cau/0fa204f88cc856c0.mp3", "Your answer is incorrect, so please correct it.": "audio/cau/2d6a22f249708653.mp3", "He spelled my name incorrectly.": "audio/cau/6f22f1fabc9ff68f.mp3", "If you answer incorrectly, try again.": "audio/cau/8a143b786c81fbef.mp3", "The coach instructs us how to swim.": "audio/cau/ebed61ab0a9121f1.mp3", "The teacher instructed us to sit down.": "audio/cau/2d5b2e8f5081ce26.mp3", "Dolphins are intelligent animals.": "audio/cau/ff347eccc7ca9ffd.mp3", "She is an intelligent student.": "audio/cau/3510c8cda7bcca9d.mp3", "City life is interesting but stressful.": "audio/cau/d3da66e08dd099e1.mp3", "The film is interesting, and everyone is interested in it.": "audio/cau/4a91c463480dae58.mp3", "English is an international language.": "audio/cau/40571347e9372f5c.mp3", "Noi Bai is an international airport.": "audio/cau/30892f46c587c1e3.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "The children jumped with joy.": "audio/cau/25a28f51bcf50f60.mp3", "Music brings joy to people.": "audio/cau/a37e5e6bd506c6c2.mp3", "My sister was born in June.": "audio/cau/4e1a4e4846ca9984.mp3", "June is the sixth month of the year.": "audio/cau/36f258a6f0f15863.mp3", "The word 'kitchen' starts with the letter k.": "audio/cau/ac85fdd0f3c32f82.mp3", "Please write a capital K on the board.": "audio/cau/f5d61da2bd65aeef.mp3", "I weigh 40 kg.": "audio/cau/07c76b9aa091f54c.mp3", "Buy 2 kg of rice, please.": "audio/cau/36934d004e807b87.mp3", "It's a perfect present for kids aged between 10 and 15.": "audio/cau/0a1ccb836dfdb1d4.mp3", "The kids play in the park; children love it.": "audio/cau/30844ad30dbeea3e.mp3", "A kilo of apples costs 50,000 dong.": "audio/cau/b910ee12d305f6c5.mp3", "The baby weighs four kilos.": "audio/cau/817660b262f5cf00.mp3", "It's only one kilometre from her house.": "audio/cau/22c7954c215e4a53.mp3", "The park is one kilometre away; the lake is two kilometres away.": "audio/cau/b2974a75870e316d.mp3", "My bag weighs five kilos.": "audio/cau/066d7ff79c3ceb44.mp3", "He lost three kilos last month.": "audio/cau/0e600e6a7ff6ae87.mp3", "My teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/a4408f8940b23d7a.mp3", "Hoa is kind to everyone, but her brother is sometimes unkind.": "audio/cau/92eef49a76085d2d.mp3", "Nguyen Hue Street is 1 km from Binh's house.": "audio/cau/227eb730489c05b8.mp3", "The lake is 5 km away, so we go by bus.": "audio/cau/3ab53a0753e4fdbc.mp3", "Do you know his life story?": "audio/cau/db0ea43493818ad0.mp3", "I know her well; I knew her at primary school.": "audio/cau/26baffaf9e8a0ddb.mp3", "Reading books gives us knowledge.": "audio/cau/3868a26411c64bc8.mp3", "He has a good knowledge of history.": "audio/cau/82ba68ba3a00f28e.mp3", "Uncle Ho is known and loved by all Vietnamese people.": "audio/cau/e714527fbec233eb.mp3", "Many people know him; he is well known in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/ea446edd847c7b43.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "Our school has a new science lab.": "audio/cau/f7118bd84235d2da.mp3", "'Lab' is short for 'laboratory'.": "audio/cau/afc02a7664a5ca83.mp3", "We do experiments in the laboratory.": "audio/cau/6b52fe5986b0e303.mp3", "The school has a new science laboratory.": "audio/cau/7ded0b2a1fdc16e1.mp3", "Hoan Kiem Lake is in the centre of Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/98e7edb5d4146709.mp3", "We walk around the lake every morning.": "audio/cau/f01b3e2f8bffaa21.mp3", "There is a lamp on my desk.": "audio/cau/80d55c1669ed8758.mp3", "Turn on the lamp; the light is too weak.": "audio/cau/19093375e9e548a3.mp3", "My house has a large garden.": "audio/cau/aca5eaaef305eea5.mp3", "Their house is large, and their garden is very big.": "audio/cau/58f11bb60767bcfb.mp3", "The town is largely quiet at night.": "audio/cau/6acff2f7d5971d4e.mp3", "Our success is largely due to teamwork.": "audio/cau/f39589c55d704f4b.mp3", "Son Doong is the largest cave in the world.": "audio/cau/e24701bf03dbe79b.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is the largest city in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/846e9ffebe286bac.mp3", "I visited my grandparents last weekend.": "audio/cau/553e8bea75bbdbbd.mp3", "Last Sunday was fun, and next Sunday will be fun too.": "audio/cau/17be93822cc3c397.mp3", "Don't be lazy; do your homework.": "audio/cau/e8cd1ea0644d6fc1.mp3", "My cat is lazy and sleeps all day.": "audio/cau/fc1756a55ab83842.mp3", "The guide will lead us to the cave.": "audio/cau/fec30eb491d4e7ec.mp3", "Eating too much sugar can lead to health problems.": "audio/cau/feb456adaea6d50e.mp3", "We learn English at school.": "audio/cau/9bc26f3d76057248.mp3", "Nam wants to learn to swim, and his sister learnt last year.": "audio/cau/5a7392296080d626.mp3", "She is a fast learner.": "audio/cau/bdda689dc68ad8a3.mp3", "This book is for English learners.": "audio/cau/5aa493db6a382d2e.mp3", "I learnt a new song today.": "audio/cau/002dc8ba978f437b.mp3", "Mi likes to learn new words; yesterday she learnt ten.": "audio/cau/01afc6c13b541caf.mp3", "Students need to sleep at least eight hours a day.": "audio/cau/06d7a5fd2aadd1a8.mp3", "Nam has less homework than Mi, and Lan has the least.": "audio/cau/144df5d8b5b5a253.mp3", "Describe your hair by its length and colour.": "audio/cau/ad23f44edd907020.mp3", "The length of the table is two metres; it's long.": "audio/cau/84f01bf78c674bd1.mp3", "Can you lengthen this skirt?": "audio/cau/0a5c035ab48364ca.mp3", "The days lengthen in summer.": "audio/cau/dbde970d0e6e0b9c.mp3", "Village life is less noisy than city life.": "audio/cau/00a225b39b028bcc.mp3", "I have little time, less than Mi; Nam has the least.": "audio/cau/310826397361a2bd.mp3", "Stop when the traffic light is red.": "audio/cau/dd4921089bcbaa08.mp3", "Turn on the light, please; the room is dark.": "audio/cau/dd20920a13027c13.mp3", "This is the lightest laptop in the shop.": "audio/cau/4e1b9050c303b263.mp3", "Feathers are the lightest things in the box.": "audio/cau/da3073815927918f.mp3", "I like noodles very much.": "audio/cau/7557928354c11c4a.mp3", "I like cats, but I dislike spiders.": "audio/cau/bdd9c25c87fbc823.mp3", "Minh likes playing football.": "audio/cau/8b21f729dbeb8632.mp3", "Hoa likes music, but I like art.": "audio/cau/e9144dc6f8053afb.mp3", "Please listen to Lan's life story carefully.": "audio/cau/5e66ffcca03d62ba.mp3", "Minh is a good listener; he always listens to his friends.": "audio/cau/2a4b1d64993cd32a.mp3", "My mum is a good listener.": "audio/cau/c361fe2d103db23c.mp3", "The radio programme has many listeners.": "audio/cau/95723f87c574336f.mp3", "Thank you for listening.": "audio/cau/ee26d140bc752b99.mp3", "Nam is listening to music; he loves to listen to pop songs.": "audio/cau/8451afe66a0bd788.mp3", "My little brother is five years old.": "audio/cau/e22af4e6bb3d77f0.mp3", "I have a little money, but my sister has less.": "audio/cau/520fdc680c743ed9.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is very lively at night.": "audio/cau/f7f9de50246fc30a.mp3", "The market is lively and busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/be87297ba2d5a7fc.mp3", "The Mekong is a very long river.": "audio/cau/962b2d2abaecb121.mp3", "Mi has long hair, but Lan has short hair.": "audio/cau/21e34cbfd1358b0e.mp3", "The Mekong is the longest river in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/4f5ce85a64c693c7.mp3", "This is the longest day of the year.": "audio/cau/18930054a17ccc1b.mp3", "Look at the board, please.": "audio/cau/512572a71fea8cfe.mp3", "Look at Minh! He is very good-looking today.": "audio/cau/3a8f3a88e8a3813b.mp3", "Mi is looking for her notebook in the bedroom.": "audio/cau/9cf0853b1a840504.mp3", "Look! Nam is looking at the picture on the wall.": "audio/cau/debf12a72a75e3eb.mp3", "Mi looks happy today.": "audio/cau/d53ae1b2afc27fcb.mp3", "Look at Nam; he looks tired.": "audio/cau/b6b16cdb7526bf98.mp3", "I love my family.": "audio/cau/02c5061798cc56cc.mp3", "My grandma is loving, and I love her a lot.": "audio/cau/588e4f5967e2076b.mp3", "What a lovely day!": "audio/cau/d4038241635895d6.mp3", "Her little sister is lovely.": "audio/cau/2566ff2d6fc065b2.mp3", "My mother is a loving person.": "audio/cau/5a0aadfbccb5dec1.mp3", "Hoa has a loving family, and she loves them a lot.": "audio/cau/dbfb0082905aad2d.mp3", "The price of this book is low.": "audio/cau/0a550bb977c74722.mp3", "The wall is very low.": "audio/cau/e9866ca6574d7e65.mp3", "Bac Giang is famous for lychees.": "audio/cau/3aabb34f26f11aac.mp3", "I eat lychees in summer.": "audio/cau/e0555ff1108b4dbc.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "He made his first computer in a small garage.": "audio/cau/ab57132318aeca10.mp3", "This vase is made of clay; people make it in Bat Trang.": "audio/cau/e23523961a9ed154.mp3", "People here mainly grow rice.": "audio/cau/39ba45d7f9277780.mp3", "I mainly use my phone for study.": "audio/cau/7e14d886ebe6707d.mp3", "Hard work can make your dreams come true.": "audio/cau/b31d6220b696ab85.mp3", "He made many mistakes, but he learnt to make good choices.": "audio/cau/f95abe45aba09ae8.mp3", "He is a famous film maker.": "audio/cau/68e4b5c408bfa483.mp3", "My uncle is a furniture maker.": "audio/cau/177cfe96f7f1bf13.mp3", "It's a healthy meal with rice, fish and vegetables.": "audio/cau/15e00b8679630207.mp3", "Minh never skips a meal.": "audio/cau/922c944c67026341.mp3", "Wash your hands before meals.": "audio/cau/4f91094291c6410d.mp3", "Nam eats three meals a day.": "audio/cau/213410209fa2a32b.mp3", "My family talks a lot at mealtime.": "audio/cau/f942497743e96a33.mp3", "Don't use your phone at mealtime.": "audio/cau/6a15fd285359279c.mp3", "Grandma mends my old shirt.": "audio/cau/c649927cc51d0853.mp3", "Can you mend this chair?": "audio/cau/818e9ef967b901ec.mp3", "The pool is 25 metres long.": "audio/cau/a65c0458b422c030.mp3", "Fansipan is 3,143 metres high.": "audio/cau/b2af19148789cb35.mp3", "Please don't misunderstand me.": "audio/cau/913575a433273816.mp3", "People often misunderstand this word.": "audio/cau/d26a103ea1d3f9ec.mp3", "I get up at six every morning.": "audio/cau/838c5da1aad62be2.mp3", "We study in the morning and play in the evening.": "audio/cau/8a176d8289d946ce.mp3", "The people in my neighbourhood are mostly friendly.": "audio/cau/54584631f0893d3f.mp3", "We mostly travel by bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/05f1e9640ad3b61c.mp3", "My mother is a nurse.": "audio/cau/7504a7ce3f463355.mp3", "Mi's mother, her mum, cooks very well.": "audio/cau/4860342249a4a0b1.mp3", "Motherhood is a wonderful job.": "audio/cau/a41df636f68c1eb3.mp3", "She enjoys motherhood very much.": "audio/cau/aae8c60a567bd35c.mp3", "Mount Everest is the highest mountain.": "audio/cau/9d438a1d616fc420.mp3", "They climbed Mount Fuji last year.": "audio/cau/c36d5eee637ee0bf.mp3", "We climbed the mountain on Sunday.": "audio/cau/3540fe0a0191a696.mp3", "There is snow on the mountain.": "audio/cau/d6fce88f07e19286.mp3", "My family will move to Da Nang next year.": "audio/cau/52a8b01da231ec79.mp3", "We moved to a new flat, and we don't want to move again.": "audio/cau/1f00cc6fb33d58c8.mp3", "Nam's family moved to the city last year.": "audio/cau/c585b20f0e51b8dc.mp3", "We moved to Hue, but we may move again soon.": "audio/cau/a9a10be2c45962d4.mp3", "Dancing needs fast movement.": "audio/cau/9a664a2d00ce92c8.mp3", "Our school joins the Green Movement.": "audio/cau/c60e5122169e11a9.mp3", "Moving to a new city can be hard.": "audio/cau/2fa286a0802dcc57.mp3", "They are moving to Ha Noi because they want to move near work.": "audio/cau/7d2136ef12f1a387.mp3", "My mum works in a hospital.": "audio/cau/6797efc1f7e404e7.mp3", "I love my mum; she is a kind mother.": "audio/cau/9c8b3cd7b9c8ebfc.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "What is your full name?": "audio/cau/3560e14e0864aa5c.mp3", "Name two products Jobs introduced after 1997.": "audio/cau/2fa79a695478cb53.mp3", "The streets in the Old Quarter are narrow.": "audio/cau/9058634a261c5e8d.mp3", "This road is narrow, but that one is wide.": "audio/cau/79669b37f4a1ddbc.mp3", "This street is narrower than mine.": "audio/cau/9310ed466849503d.mp3", "The river gets narrower here.": "audio/cau/fb37c03c3e13abb0.mp3", "Our team narrowly won the match.": "audio/cau/c1801a7dcf731a27.mp3", "He narrowly missed the bus.": "audio/cau/d7525e854554ccc9.mp3", "There is a big park nearby.": "audio/cau/0bbea8d853e59092.mp3", "My school is near my house, and a market is nearby too.": "audio/cau/b046b21263949e43.mp3", "It's nearly six o'clock, so let's go home.": "audio/cau/245ae82d42650c9f.mp3", "Nam nearly missed the bus; he was almost late.": "audio/cau/b606a8d1edcf35c6.mp3", "She never gave up her dream.": "audio/cau/b95a5dea82e7f24d.mp3", "Never give up; always try your best.": "audio/cau/45044467beb1d1bf.mp3", "It was raining. Nevertheless, we went out.": "audio/cau/96e041b73011f4c0.mp3", "The test was hard. Nevertheless, I passed.": "audio/cau/f2dd49917bd958c6.mp3", "See you next week!": "audio/cau/e955abbc627cb84b.mp3", "Last week we had a test, and next week we have a trip.": "audio/cau/e51bba1694cc9fe2.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai.": "audio/cau/7c4c4da145e9a59d.mp3", "Lan is nice, and she always speaks nicely.": "audio/cau/b93deacf2eeac62d.mp3", "The city is noisy at night.": "audio/cau/003950b6dbcd9d77.mp3", "We went out last night, so tonight we stay at home.": "audio/cau/334224d67553dca2.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City has an exciting nightlife.": "audio/cau/db63b206001cd606.mp3", "The nightlife here is lively, and the streets are busy at night.": "audio/cau/3d60979904eca10a.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "The verb 'do' needs an object.": "audio/cau/39d543adf72c24e9.mp3", "In 'I love music', 'music' is the object.": "audio/cau/695391fd78ce8c91.mp3", "Turn off the lights when you leave.": "audio/cau/3a68f3ab6e248006.mp3", "Turn on the fan, but turn off the TV.": "audio/cau/bdd957c99adde5f0.mp3", "I often get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/08008a46175a2d25.mp3", "Minh often reads books, but he never plays games.": "audio/cau/a29cadde346ad9ba.mp3", "Get enough sleep every night; otherwise, your health will suffer.": "audio/cau/88349a162c32012c.mp3", "Wear a coat; otherwise, you might catch a cold.": "audio/cau/58a979e859eb4708.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "The city has many outdoor markets.": "audio/cau/70f031e665dcb6a3.mp3", "Phong likes outdoor sports, so he often plays outdoors.": "audio/cau/62d7cb3e1f835b37.mp3", "Eating too much sugar can make you overweight.": "audio/cau/9df60b1ba5192e48.mp3", "My cat is a bit overweight.": "audio/cau/1f030b1da6ac37b8.mp3", "She started her own business at the age of 25.": "audio/cau/6b63e0d466da083a.mp3", "Lan has her own bike, and her dad owns a shop.": "audio/cau/3e685e99b02109d7.mp3", "Who is the owner of this bag?": "audio/cau/267db4164d6de47a.mp3", "Mi is the owner of the blue bike.": "audio/cau/6fd99520869ed0ff.mp3", "Car ownership is growing in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/871e182190a20876.mp3", "Who has ownership of this land?": "audio/cau/7e76308bc5da9307.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "I like to paint pictures of flowers.": "audio/cau/f44d6f9b195d10c6.mp3", "We paint the house before Tet.": "audio/cau/d0f71b5285157539.mp3", "Read the first paragraph and answer the question.": "audio/cau/43e8d58106b6726a.mp3", "Write a short paragraph of about 80 words.": "audio/cau/79fc537e0a2633c9.mp3", "Mai and Lan swap paragraphs and check them.": "audio/cau/8ce60ddee9a706f4.mp3", "Minh writes two paragraphs about his daily routine.": "audio/cau/cfa99a15b21c6270.mp3", "Use the words in parentheses.": "audio/cau/c654b42b83e8fb4f.mp3", "Put the verbs in parentheses in the correct form.": "audio/cau/5c76924820458187.mp3", "This part of the lesson is about friends.": "audio/cau/fe137d473624dc0c.mp3", "We take part in the game, and it is partly about music.": "audio/cau/f86fd833e90206a2.mp3", "It will be partly cloudy tomorrow.": "audio/cau/2e9279ced890cd59.mp3", "The story is partly true.": "audio/cau/a56a321d8dcb3386.mp3", "The lesson has three parts.": "audio/cau/1b1d9c097e2f0ab4.mp3", "Name the parts of the face: eyes, nose and mouth.": "audio/cau/1959d4fcb37c5b1b.mp3", "There are five people in my family.": "audio/cau/61d24a117613907d.mp3", "One person is late, but the other people are here.": "audio/cau/b4e5b7ba18b09096.mp3", "He is a kind and hard-working person.": "audio/cau/a7cc8ccdfee48d42.mp3", "One person came first, then many people came.": "audio/cau/e2f7a3bc001f7fc0.mp3", "This is my personal diary.": "audio/cau/4bb512632de09306.mp3", "Don't share personal information online.": "audio/cau/e4de8d484708e9e5.mp3", "Hoa has a friendly personality.": "audio/cau/5e968c0ca289e9bb.mp3", "Minh has a strong character and a kind personality.": "audio/cau/e35df7bcc2cd6179.mp3", "I use my phone to call my grandparents.": "audio/cau/8e9996c8fa495f09.mp3", "Lan phoned me last night on her new phone.": "audio/cau/8ac9d116e44bf63f.mp3", "'Look after' is a phrasal verb.": "audio/cau/af602eb955e2891a.mp3", "Learn each phrase and use the phrasal verbs in sentences.": "audio/cau/40a96f6869b52557.mp3", "Match each phrase with its meaning.": "audio/cau/557dd9e0b36c6f5f.mp3", "'Go out' is a phrasal verb, and 'in the city' is a phrase.": "audio/cau/ca722714e28c9b92.mp3", "Use these phrases in your presentation.": "audio/cau/4f40d1db291eb325.mp3", "Write one phrase from the box, then add two more phrases.": "audio/cau/f53433a3dd4c0563.mp3", "Pick a card, please.": "audio/cau/1e4e9d51e347aede.mp3", "We pick tea leaves in the morning.": "audio/cau/c487a2bfd0d8d890.mp3", "She has a pink bag.": "audio/cau/112305e7e7f6836e.mp3", "The flowers are pink and white.": "audio/cau/4f4fa22eb74bac39.mp3", "We need a plan for our project.": "audio/cau/e33a8fe9fb341903.mp3", "Nam planned his trip carefully with his family.": "audio/cau/f61c169a10484b3b.mp3", "I write my homework in my planner.": "audio/cau/f7a7a7fc93e7626c.mp3", "She is a wedding planner.": "audio/cau/ad4db7837b0e87a1.mp3", "Good planning helps you study better.": "audio/cau/3e380d555c079d24.mp3", "Make a plan for your week and use a planner.": "audio/cau/c7d1745603e5bd75.mp3", "There is a plant next to the window.": "audio/cau/ead07f80a6f49805.mp3", "Mi plants flowers and waters the plants every day.": "audio/cau/8379ade47936222a.mp3", "Plants need water and sunlight.": "audio/cau/e6bc337addd58412.mp3", "People make com from young rice plants.": "audio/cau/5ab8c23c4ad5e1eb.mp3", "We had a pleasant day at the craft village.": "audio/cau/e1f0b1cdb0d3b469.mp3", "The weather is pleasant today, not unpleasant like yesterday.": "audio/cau/d39fb3e0aac88724.mp3", "I'm pleased to meet you.": "audio/cau/f7277017f0c93fd1.mp3", "The teacher is pleased with our work.": "audio/cau/ef3a88639bfe5e25.mp3", "It's a pleasure to talk to you.": "audio/cau/eff2f68747b92dda.mp3", "Reading gives my grandmother a lot of pleasure.": "audio/cau/09e7f994211010c0.mp3", "The air in big cities is often polluted.": "audio/cau/3f2265c1134300cf.mp3", "Traffic causes air pollution, so the city is polluted.": "audio/cau/41cbf08c31632fed.mp3", "This is a powerful computer.": "audio/cau/85ae80d24de8ae8c.mp3", "The storm was very powerful.": "audio/cau/6a353ad61142eb6b.mp3", "Each group will present their project to the class.": "audio/cau/6116c3864aebd817.mp3", "Hoa presented her project about her grandfather.": "audio/cau/199806383df2605a.mp3", "Our group gave a presentation about a famous person.": "audio/cau/19eabc250c35918d.mp3", "Minh presents the first part of the presentation.": "audio/cau/97ffec456b1ba8a6.mp3", "She is a TV presenter.": "audio/cau/12a3eb4b246723e1.mp3", "The presenter asked many questions.": "audio/cau/cf8a5c5982b7bec0.mp3", "Look at the previous page.": "audio/cau/5236de3455b3c630.mp3", "I met her the previous day.": "audio/cau/209d74f5321dec53.mp3", "Our group is doing a project about a famous person.": "audio/cau/c9daf131fff9ae9e.mp3", "We show our project on the projector.": "audio/cau/268ba89e01254eff.mp3", "The teacher uses a projector in class.": "audio/cau/bf7a5b7d233e514f.mp3", "Turn on the projector, please.": "audio/cau/bd14a2766f89d167.mp3", "There are 40 pupils in my class.": "audio/cau/fa147b5c3216f8cc.mp3", "She is a good pupil.": "audio/cau/e17bb8917e55a7f5.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "This bird is very rare.": "audio/cau/48fafe88c8e922d6.mp3", "Snow is rare in Ho Chi Minh City.": "audio/cau/10cf42b4395f3004.mp3", "I rarely go to the cinema.": "audio/cau/665f28d3968d7eec.mp3", "Snow is rare in Ha Noi, so we rarely see it.": "audio/cau/651a9aa109c5d5ab.mp3", "I read a book before bed every night.": "audio/cau/52f4120305948c56.mp3", "Yesterday Mi read a story, because reading is her hobby.": "audio/cau/a206c7fecbd29a47.mp3", "My sister is a fast reader.": "audio/cau/c997b3414e90f2e3.mp3", "Lan is a good reader because she reads every day.": "audio/cau/804882ef0e352a60.mp3", "Reading helps us learn new words.": "audio/cau/a36b0142402545f6.mp3", "I read a story last night, and it was great.": "audio/cau/67941e0da7d7be3c.mp3", "Lan is wearing a red dress.": "audio/cau/ae3c1aa62302c501.mp3", "The sky is reddish at sunset, and the sun is red.": "audio/cau/6fcd7d055aec1d60.mp3", "Her face reddened with shame.": "audio/cau/c4b17db98348529e.mp3", "The sky reddens at sunset.": "audio/cau/79b8bc812bf2328d.mp3", "The soil here is reddish.": "audio/cau/21247bce2f5817e5.mp3", "She has reddish hair.": "audio/cau/3ad30383a224ec0d.mp3", "My dad can repair old bikes.": "audio/cau/1a5693c52a55b7be.mp3", "The repair was quick; he fixed the roof in an hour.": "audio/cau/bd041dd84c999eeb.mp3", "How does Elena reply to her mum?": "audio/cau/dcaf59d7091175e8.mp3", "Please reply to my email soon.": "audio/cau/1fbb259adb0f0a8b.mp3", "If you don't feel well, you can stay at home and rest.": "audio/cau/80c50d7bcdc0aa2e.mp3", "Hoa rests for ten minutes after running.": "audio/cau/0e4d9ca9b895f037.mp3", "We had dinner at a restaurant.": "audio/cau/2d6c0a016ebc69ef.mp3", "This restaurant serves good pho.": "audio/cau/4390ddbb6912136e.mp3", "There are many restaurants in the city centre.": "audio/cau/df35820a24aa24d8.mp3", "We had dinner at a restaurant near the lake.": "audio/cau/c687fd50a686a391.mp3", "Your answer is right, Nam.": "audio/cau/de0207c9ebd60141.mp3", "Is this answer right or wrong?": "audio/cau/6f5632fc348cdcbc.mp3", "She rightly said no.": "audio/cau/0716d99ea752c0a9.mp3", "He was rightly proud of his work.": "audio/cau/82f83dc7701970f6.mp3", "My aunt's house is near the river.": "audio/cau/a6e8ddca094f143a.mp3", "We swim in the river in summer.": "audio/cau/ad856ac1e2451519.mp3", "We had a picnic by the riverside.": "audio/cau/7c9b83750b247a1b.mp3", "There is a riverside café.": "audio/cau/2fc65f9804bd39f5.mp3", "This robot can help people clean the house.": "audio/cau/abb1c1ffc510fec1.mp3", "Nam has a robot and many other robotic toys.": "audio/cau/180c8c82c4eb569d.mp3", "We saw a robotic arm in the factory.": "audio/cau/0faecff22a0186d3.mp3", "His voice sounds robotic.": "audio/cau/690d793dfc5c09b0.mp3", "My brother joined the robotics club.": "audio/cau/ac3208f1ad0effa3.mp3", "Robotics is growing fast.": "audio/cau/1535ff89b36cc8b0.mp3", "Robots may cook and clean for us one day.": "audio/cau/fa7e5831327603d0.mp3", "Our school robot can answer simple questions.": "audio/cau/a35f70868eedba43.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "I feel sad when it rains.": "audio/cau/eb933f7742f31790.mp3", "It's a sad story.": "audio/cau/609036f450dba425.mp3", "Her eyes were full of sadness.": "audio/cau/c859a19efbe96ee4.mp3", "Music can help with sadness.": "audio/cau/ce070d4025e717bf.mp3", "I said, can you pass me the book?": "audio/cau/e2db7c41d720581d.mp3", "The teacher said we should sleep early.": "audio/cau/f9528b768b823292.mp3", "Mi and I are in the same class.": "audio/cau/bc1a18955ee28275.mp3", "My bag is the same as yours, not different.": "audio/cau/b8e990694854227f.mp3", "What do you say when you meet someone?": "audio/cau/ebd766cb7a0b37c7.mp3", "Say hello! Mi said hello to everyone.": "audio/cau/835b6b164eec79c4.mp3", "What is the artisan saying about his work?": "audio/cau/758a63f41cdaea82.mp3", "Grandpa said an old saying about hard work.": "audio/cau/dae1465b6bed02a4.mp3", "I put my books in my schoolbag before school.": "audio/cau/c492164eb59da7f4.mp3", "My schoolbag is too heavy today.": "audio/cau/8d0a65c64cf8ce99.mp3", "She puts her books in her schoolbag.": "audio/cau/3f97f32ee71ad86a.mp3", "Lan is my schoolmate, not my classmate.": "audio/cau/e2d3147caa8ce83b.mp3", "I met a schoolmate at the bookshop.": "audio/cau/600fe95b9cf0ba63.mp3", "I seldom watch TV on school days.": "audio/cau/9eac1d68b1aaf03d.mp3", "My dad seldom gets angry with us.": "audio/cau/8296aefbed0f630f.mp3", "Select the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/fa11d36a6784e8b9.mp3", "She selected a red dress for the party.": "audio/cau/949a496976983bca.mp3", "Write a sentence about your family.": "audio/cau/9ffdb94eb27ae024.mp3", "This sentence is short and easy to read.": "audio/cau/f99b7a9b5f47ebe1.mp3", "Please write five sentences about your best friend.": "audio/cau/9fbb8a8d97d0001d.mp3", "The first sentence is easy, but the other sentences are hard.": "audio/cau/8cf810890ade1eda.mp3", "Air pollution is a serious problem.": "audio/cau/451a7484a9226374.mp3", "Our teacher looks serious today.": "audio/cau/128bbd7598114bcd.mp3", "Jobs and Wozniak set up Apple in 1976.": "audio/cau/48673803c7bf8992.mp3", "Mi set her alarm for six o'clock yesterday.": "audio/cau/92e32160df23e27c.mp3", "Let's go to the shop to buy a lamp.": "audio/cau/02d8310bb74af7bc.mp3", "There is a small shop near my house.": "audio/cau/e63a93ab9fc8033d.mp3", "The shopper paid with her phone.": "audio/cau/82693d164cb86375.mp3", "A smart shopper compares prices first.": "audio/cau/b7f5abffe4fe148b.mp3", "My mum goes shopping on Sunday mornings.": "audio/cau/9edd7bc7a6da8213.mp3", "Mi likes shopping at the small shops near her house.": "audio/cau/9b5fc040769efc5a.mp3", "There are many shops along this street.": "audio/cau/f8d089fcbdb1b89b.mp3", "My aunt has a small shop near the school.": "audio/cau/d1a736005c66edb9.mp3", "My brother is short, but he plays basketball well.": "audio/cau/d8ddf117afef7434.mp3", "Minh is tall, but his brother is short.": "audio/cau/fa281035bc257ead.mp3", "Please shorten your report to one page.": "audio/cau/dee63c16ae986ee6.mp3", "The story is too long, so make it short.": "audio/cau/b95346b6a813da23.mp3", "Show your photos to the class.": "audio/cau/2238dc578e393ea6.mp3", "Nam showed us photos of his village.": "audio/cau/212c93e8427b7095.mp3", "The artisan showed us how to make lanterns.": "audio/cau/897188b380de15ca.mp3", "Please show me too; you showed Mi yesterday.": "audio/cau/f493ef15d21acfbb.mp3", "The film is shown on TV tonight.": "audio/cau/75e35008646b299e.mp3", "She has shown me her new room.": "audio/cau/d93aaba1ebaa7897.mp3", "Use simple words in your presentation.": "audio/cau/685b89e962568275.mp3", "The task is simple; simply read and answer.": "audio/cau/f9dad5cdcce61ac9.mp3", "We sing English songs in class.": "audio/cau/026846f6b8826235.mp3", "Mi sang a song; she is a good singer.": "audio/cau/880ccad023e24637.mp3", "My sister wants to be a singer.": "audio/cau/8a321cf9c02f1183.mp3", "Who is your favourite singer?": "audio/cau/61920cc689201a93.mp3", "Lan is singing a song for her friends.": "audio/cau/f33095eb48c8ac05.mp3", "Nam loves singing, and he sang at the party.": "audio/cau/9fafc99845e3f01a.mp3", "My house is small but cosy.": "audio/cau/361843b6d8177bed.mp3", "I live in a small flat, not a big house.": "audio/cau/e341afdae498f225.mp3", "My village is smaller than the city.": "audio/cau/77ad0931648736fe.mp3", "This shop is small, but that one is even smaller.": "audio/cau/0d67ec98fa2886f3.mp3", "This is the smallest room in the house.": "audio/cau/be5f404374212531.mp3", "Vatican City is the smallest country in the world.": "audio/cau/df407ba4f28abf48.mp3", "Ha Noi is planning to become a smart city.": "audio/cau/534a2d2742fd455c.mp3", "My smart cousin made an app for smartphones.": "audio/cau/a451335c10c8aa7f.mp3", "Minh is the smartest student in our class.": "audio/cau/52f9419a66ab2dc0.mp3", "This is the smartest robot I've ever seen.": "audio/cau/85227846dad7eace.mp3", "He was smartly dressed for the party.": "audio/cau/88e290727a0dd91d.mp3", "She smartly solved the problem.": "audio/cau/7e41ccd8721cc114.mp3", "Many teenagers use a smartphone every day.": "audio/cau/5ebfc7f85b461743.mp3", "Nam's smartphone is smart: it can translate English.": "audio/cau/023fcc72924c361c.mp3", "Please smile for the photo, everyone!": "audio/cau/a4728b3dac5304d4.mp3", "Mi has a lovely smile, and she smiles at everyone.": "audio/cau/51d4f7536425a4be.mp3", "Look! Nam is smiling in this photo.": "audio/cau/c1a3d6a258a4483a.mp3", "In this photo, Linh is smiling and making a V-sign.": "audio/cau/7835814f96bcc803.mp3", "I'm so pleased you won the prize!": "audio/cau/345d567c5208a7af.mp3", "It was raining, so we stayed at home.": "audio/cau/d3e8c1c4c40bf63a.mp3", "This is my favourite song.": "audio/cau/541e14c148c17e10.mp3", "Let's sing a song together!": "audio/cau/2582c08c2be3a294.mp3", "Our city needs more space for parks.": "audio/cau/4789110f4d6851be.mp3", "The new flat is spacious, with lots of space.": "audio/cau/9028743b09798c85.mp3", "Can you speak English well?": "audio/cau/7e70c8ed41dd5f73.mp3", "Mi spoke to her teacher after class.": "audio/cau/9631c4f9d08103cf.mp3", "She is a good English speaker.": "audio/cau/ad8983e10a3153eb.mp3", "Turn up the speaker, please.": "audio/cau/176c25890d4baf0b.mp3", "Our head teacher gave a short speech today.": "audio/cau/d7f9999a0661fac2.mp3", "Mi will speak first, then Nam will give his speech.": "audio/cau/e7405c38166acf2a.mp3", "She spoke English very well.": "audio/cau/021d27ba9b445e58.mp3", "I spoke to my teacher after class.": "audio/cau/8a7ed13ad52bfd30.mp3", "Our English lesson will start at eight.": "audio/cau/920ac7d03b952080.mp3", "We start at seven and finish at eleven.": "audio/cau/f8b0988a876acebc.mp3", "Good sleep keeps you in a healthy state.": "audio/cau/7049cd3c8f8cac73.mp3", "Exercise can improve your state of mind.": "audio/cau/694d7b4b952786de.mp3", "Read the statements and choose True or False.": "audio/cau/5f41d85ba1cc95cf.mp3", "The principal made a statement about the trip.": "audio/cau/9ca8f7090ffddefd.mp3", "Read the statements and choose T or F.": "audio/cau/d81feacfec03b769.mp3", "This statement is true, but the other statements are false.": "audio/cau/d3dd00a2a9c02930.mp3", "My phone doesn't have enough storage.": "audio/cau/3a5f01cbd2fd8f6f.mp3", "We use the attic for storage.": "audio/cau/b6d76a321b8d9aee.mp3", "The store is near our house.": "audio/cau/499a1bc50d7cd647.mp3", "Let's go to the store this weekend.": "audio/cau/df90dc123d86e998.mp3", "We live in a three-storey house.": "audio/cau/7fefeb256802fa55.mp3", "The library is on the top storey.": "audio/cau/1af2e4bf9124d14e.mp3", "My grandmother tells us funny stories.": "audio/cau/e69e0bbbad7fb5c7.mp3", "This story is the best of all the stories.": "audio/cau/1eb1cd37d5f5f117.mp3", "Let me tell you the story of my life.": "audio/cau/d98d4ebd73512026.mp3", "Mr Minh is a good storyteller; his story is moving.": "audio/cau/394bef52e88a63eb.mp3", "My grandma is a great storyteller.": "audio/cau/5e7c88fb2310eebf.mp3", "The storyteller made the children laugh.": "audio/cau/3b52a1dad829ac46.mp3", "You need strength to lift this box.": "audio/cau/3dbbf834979fca6e.mp3", "Patience is her greatest strength.": "audio/cau/3aa59f2197df2571.mp3", "Exercise strengthens your body.": "audio/cau/9dbdd04fb9ceff86.mp3", "Group work strengthens friendship.": "audio/cau/ce2040e852487065.mp3", "The people in my village have strong ties.": "audio/cau/820ea51c66a51b95.mp3", "Phong is strong, but his little brother is weak.": "audio/cau/73e0a188067b76d4.mp3", "He is the strongest boy in our class.": "audio/cau/0633159368caf5f2.mp3", "The elephant is one of the strongest animals.": "audio/cau/8aa69f278b73b827.mp3", "I strongly agree with you.": "audio/cau/2f823f9ce66857f6.mp3", "The wind was blowing strongly.": "audio/cau/5845f28dcfb6a05b.mp3", "Mi is a student at Ba Dinh Secondary School.": "audio/cau/569937b828afcac4.mp3", "Every student must study hard for the test.": "audio/cau/88443b78f0da0120.mp3", "My father studied in Hue many years ago.": "audio/cau/555618b0b141ce97.mp3", "She was a good student and studied very hard.": "audio/cau/c9b1736ba6011626.mp3", "Mi studies English every evening.": "audio/cau/b1218f9b9530760b.mp3", "Nam studied hard last year, and now he studies even harder.": "audio/cau/9817881934cebf3a.mp3", "Lan is a studious girl.": "audio/cau/05497c979da2f836.mp3", "Studious students often get good marks.": "audio/cau/56f0c28f3e5463f3.mp3", "I study English every evening.": "audio/cau/2a98035816ae0fe1.mp3", "Hoa is a studious student; she likes to study maths.": "audio/cau/81fcae64bc4c3e71.mp3", "It was stupid to go out in the storm.": "audio/cau/0351acace7c0b0e1.mp3", "Don't call your friends stupid.": "audio/cau/990524047e4281cb.mp3", "My favourite subject is science.": "audio/cau/a04c6f77a736db47.mp3", "Maths is a hard subject, but I like it.": "audio/cau/47c097cdda067846.mp3", "We study ten subjects at school.": "audio/cau/65e4952b532af83a.mp3", "Of all my subjects, English is my favourite subject.": "audio/cau/b316509d6a4659ff.mp3", "We have no classes on Sunday.": "audio/cau/0ddcc7c7e69398d0.mp3", "On Sunday, Minh visits his grandparents.": "audio/cau/c79a24253c94cc63.mp3", "Hoa plays badminton on Sundays.": "audio/cau/6ca9773059cd7414.mp3", "On Sundays, we usually have lunch with our grandparents.": "audio/cau/93f12ac3b2d5f767.mp3", "'Tallest' is the superlative of 'tall'.": "audio/cau/077d729f47509445.mp3", "Use superlatives to compare three or more things.": "audio/cau/cc694720ea2987a3.mp3", "Friends support each other in hard times.": "audio/cau/c25544ac51cf812c.mp3", "My parents are supportive; they always support me.": "audio/cau/bc09957a4f6cc0ae.mp3", "He is a big supporter of our football team.": "audio/cau/05f9cbac79242db9.mp3", "My mum is my best supporter.": "audio/cau/6cf35e491fceed7f.mp3", "My friends are very supportive.": "audio/cau/b3dc62ec25250ceb.mp3", "Teachers should be supportive of students.": "audio/cau/bc0a4c71b00deae6.mp3", "Nguyen is a common surname in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/c8102c73dadc352c.mp3", "What is your surname?": "audio/cau/67eafe2d8243a1d5.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "Put your books on the table, please.": "audio/cau/467dab8d487aa55a.mp3", "Our timetable is a table of all our lessons.": "audio/cau/995dc4d40f2b5ff8.mp3", "Don't forget to take your umbrella.": "audio/cau/d1c93b06561e343d.mp3", "I take the bus to school; yesterday I took a taxi.": "audio/cau/6de67298648ceb25.mp3", "This photo was taken in Hue.": "audio/cau/f504f1fe8bdf2bf6.mp3", "Have you taken your medicine?": "audio/cau/28798ff67a8368e9.mp3", "Mi is taking photos of the flowers.": "audio/cau/13a0bae7bf3bc40c.mp3", "We are taking a bus now; we took a train last week.": "audio/cau/5e43700c2b0ef208.mp3", "Grandma told us a tale about a magic fish.": "audio/cau/969ddb5894d2cfc4.mp3", "'Tam Cam' is a Vietnamese folk tale.": "audio/cau/af017bf121707bac.mp3", "Children love fairy tales.": "audio/cau/bcae153c0f88b396.mp3", "He told funny tales about his travels.": "audio/cau/ad7211d182774e8b.mp3", "I often talk to my grandma on the phone.": "audio/cau/30262ea1745db608.mp3", "Lan is talkative; she loves to talk and chat with friends.": "audio/cau/ef14453a567466fc.mp3", "My little sister is very talkative.": "audio/cau/abe6afbd7c67a621.mp3", "He is shy, not talkative.": "audio/cau/c9c299a5fd04a0e9.mp3", "My father is very tall.": "audio/cau/fbbb73825cd6c0b9.mp3", "Minh is tall, but Phong is short.": "audio/cau/dc16694351cdb299.mp3", "Nam is the tallest boy in my class.": "audio/cau/eec872ddb478ee49.mp3", "Landmark 81 is the tallest building in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/9c1caae0c8f0a625.mp3", "The soup is tasteless without salt.": "audio/cau/69fb662d255c70f3.mp3", "Hospital food is often tasteless.": "audio/cau/dfa5db27aad914df.mp3", "Mum's spring rolls are very tasty.": "audio/cau/3e36af0fdc823b82.mp3", "This street food is cheap and tasty.": "audio/cau/ecba6c175b91796e.mp3", "My mum taught me how to cook.": "audio/cau/26258741e92965e1.mp3", "Mr Minh taught us English last year.": "audio/cau/c50edf18517998fc.mp3", "My mother will teach me how to cook.": "audio/cau/a219134d114e3ba6.mp3", "Mr Minh taught me English, and he is a great teacher.": "audio/cau/f4262b30c0d7e28d.mp3", "Our English teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/4869000a32bce322.mp3", "Ms Hoa taught us maths last year; she is a great teacher.": "audio/cau/01cfa396481f53ff.mp3", "Ms Lan is teaching Class 6A now.": "audio/cau/acf50be4cb481bbc.mp3", "My aunt is a teacher; she loves teaching.": "audio/cau/8c228681a916a270.mp3", "Please tell me about your hometown.": "audio/cau/d5098eae824e03fa.mp3", "My grandpa told me a story last night.": "audio/cau/ba19b792ce3534dc.mp3", "Thank you for your help.": "audio/cau/f1b6ff2034f49180.mp3", "I want to thank my teacher; I am thankful to her.": "audio/cau/e425280c59f568bd.mp3", "We are thankful to the people in our community.": "audio/cau/223a6b926026e8db.mp3", "I am thankful for your help, so I thank you a lot.": "audio/cau/6f44905722dacb4f.mp3", "Thankfully, nobody was hurt.": "audio/cau/7bd5f8cb0cb1f3b1.mp3", "Thankfully, the rain stopped before the match.": "audio/cau/80e95fd617deb78b.mp3", "There is a big garden in my house.": "audio/cau/94db3c106fafa1ac.mp3", "Your bag is here, and my bag is over there.": "audio/cau/37204e4c7e951d02.mp3", "The most important thing is to be honest.": "audio/cau/c302c847e8e66725.mp3", "Something is wrong; one thing is missing from my bag.": "audio/cau/c14d87bcc3d6fc9b.mp3", "I put my things in my schoolbag.": "audio/cau/bf35bafff88418e4.mp3", "There are many good things at my school, not just one thing.": "audio/cau/26ddc5ba45fd5524.mp3", "Lan has the tidiest desk in the class.": "audio/cau/07ddae632fe5ea2b.mp3", "This is the tidiest room in the house.": "audio/cau/ad6bcb20fb8bde96.mp3", "She put her books tidily on the shelf.": "audio/cau/9ee57a50c695c12c.mp3", "Please fold your clothes tidily.": "audio/cau/6c0ec0438609888f.mp3", "Hoa helps her mum tidy the house every weekend.": "audio/cau/75ef93fb6a1caa12.mp3", "Please tidy your desk before you go out, Nam.": "audio/cau/45374a843a380a3a.mp3", "Let's look at our new timetable.": "audio/cau/b37160eda36c9395.mp3", "We have Maths on Monday according to the timetable.": "audio/cau/46e65b162f79e5db.mp3", "Today is Monday, and I have maths.": "audio/cau/a2c1db38d6bad1f7.mp3", "It is sunny today, so we play outside.": "audio/cau/43f448f8abe01280.mp3", "My grandma told me a funny story.": "audio/cau/f87f67862f96ec79.mp3", "The teacher told us to be quiet.": "audio/cau/42fba1ee1bbe34c4.mp3", "Learning Vietnamese tones is difficult for foreigners.": "audio/cau/375bcffb5ad50967.mp3", "The painting has warm tones.": "audio/cau/34fcb4b96bea6181.mp3", "Lan is going to bed early tonight.": "audio/cau/082a4a419bcc862e.mp3", "If you stay up late tonight, you might feel tired tomorrow.": "audio/cau/67679aa3684d9212.mp3", "I'm optimistic about the exam I took last week.": "audio/cau/98111979a0b1df4c.mp3", "Minh took the bus to school.": "audio/cau/d8fe913a07c52d8e.mp3", "I totally agree with you.": "audio/cau/2ed025b410dc2507.mp3", "The town is totally different now; it changed completely.": "audio/cau/7c44b917714a1ef2.mp3", "The instructions are unclear.": "audio/cau/a43798fe877cb4df.mp3", "It is unclear why he left.": "audio/cau/b5afe1c155faad27.mp3", "Do you understand the question, Hoa?": "audio/cau/4aad582adc859dab.mp3", "Minh understood the lesson, but Lan didn't understand it.": "audio/cau/d720b04327d8be8a.mp3", "I understood the lesson well.": "audio/cau/1d67b1ee5c74135b.mp3", "Have you understood the question?": "audio/cau/a1e59e5170364849.mp3", "The doctor said the child was underweight.": "audio/cau/db4b3f565c078088.mp3", "Eating too little can make you underweight.": "audio/cau/9283cb92ebb4155e.mp3", "Don't be ungrateful to your parents.": "audio/cau/972d682898dd93a4.mp3", "The ungrateful boy didn't say thank you.": "audio/cau/1b786f8c43c1aa81.mp3", "Loneliness can cause unhappiness.": "audio/cau/da585a08ee762949.mp3", "She hid her unhappiness from her friends.": "audio/cau/72c710e641ba4864.mp3", "People are unhappy with the traffic jams.": "audio/cau/8f666d0d974f8f0e.mp3", "Lan was unhappy yesterday, but today she is happy.": "audio/cau/79b51e0a7de4a479.mp3", "The shop assistant was unhelpful.": "audio/cau/72e4a1fc9b333f47.mp3", "This map is unhelpful.": "audio/cau/a647e15849c7448e.mp3", "The workers wear a green uniform with stripes.": "audio/cau/b182c1a9488baa66.mp3", "We wear our school uniform from Monday to Friday.": "audio/cau/4c928807169b0cdf.mp3", "The writer of this song is unknown.": "audio/cau/34fd2674ae6ed3a3.mp3", "They travelled to unknown places.": "audio/cau/d5bf3d5c45b79db6.mp3", "My brother's room is always untidy.": "audio/cau/2d24a6095b534da2.mp3", "Don't leave your desk untidy.": "audio/cau/707b44454d306742.mp3", "It's unusual to see snow in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/e05b05b1ff1ae1b4.mp3", "She has an unusual name.": "audio/cau/8b34ff4e430332df.mp3", "Nam grew up in a small village.": "audio/cau/40830ead9e37bc73.mp3", "Lan walked up the hill and then came down.": "audio/cau/815acf6571d188ca.mp3", "We use computers to make our visual story.": "audio/cau/1f9e65093a2c0cf1.mp3", "This app is very useful, and I use it every day.": "audio/cau/7434eb2ec1577d85.mp3", "This dictionary is very useful.": "audio/cau/d616d82dd437efdf.mp3", "A computer is useful, but a broken one is useless.": "audio/cau/061aada006d6e574.mp3", "Spend your free time usefully.": "audio/cau/a5f343473daf5755.mp3", "Old bottles can be used usefully as pots.": "audio/cau/f80325fc53a6f5a0.mp3", "We talked about the usefulness of the Internet.": "audio/cau/1fa0f0d5fcdf7de1.mp3", "The usefulness of this tool is clear.": "audio/cau/a1f35dfbac0c1e29.mp3", "This broken umbrella is useless.": "audio/cau/87f4d5c1e27eee06.mp3", "It's useless to cry now.": "audio/cau/d2efa23c3f23f8b7.mp3", "Facebook has millions of users.": "audio/cau/3955ede83592bd40.mp3", "Enter your user name here.": "audio/cau/8f967e17a7ac312d.mp3", "She is using a computer to write her story.": "audio/cau/c0867dfe4d3cf7aa.mp3", "Minh used a map yesterday, and today he is using his phone.": "audio/cau/2f51e71c740b9c6e.mp3", "I got up at the usual time.": "audio/cau/290a01bde4a43987.mp3", "As usual, she was late.": "audio/cau/dbda02aadf09e9b8.mp3", "I usually get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/56d7578c4454be93.mp3", "Mi usually walks to school, so it is unusual for her to be late.": "audio/cau/3e33c944667515e1.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "'Play' is a verb, but 'happy' is not.": "audio/cau/7cb0163f6a27d0af.mp3", "Underline the verb in each sentence.": "audio/cau/c45fa8ec83b8ba93.mp3", "Write the -ing form of these verbs.": "audio/cau/9a8d4d3f46f1577e.mp3", "'Run' and 'swim' are verbs; can you find one more verb?": "audio/cau/1cd8c87f9c695ab7.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "Vote for the strangest house.": "audio/cau/442368ec90871479.mp3", "Our class voted for Mi, and she got ten votes.": "audio/cau/cd00e0ddd3f75dfe.mp3", "Every voter must show an ID card.": "audio/cau/bd889a7ffa98c2a8.mp3", "Young voters care about the environment.": "audio/cau/f5d87fa39afb5b1c.mp3", "It's warm today.": "audio/cau/cc0e8ca9006d57a2.mp3", "Wear a warm coat in winter.": "audio/cau/95aec6c826de01b5.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "Nam washes the dishes after dinner.": "audio/cau/673df5024605d57a.mp3", "This jacket is washable.": "audio/cau/549324cd8936d15d.mp3", "Use washable paint in the classroom.": "audio/cau/ee02332b6d76b892.mp3", "Mum is washing the dishes now.": "audio/cau/216100eca6d39bf6.mp3", "Lan washes her face, then she helps with the washing.": "audio/cau/599b24c079571a59.mp3", "We watch TV after dinner.": "audio/cau/8b47f4f4b321b7f8.mp3", "Nam is watching a film; his new watch is on the table.": "audio/cau/850cc4ddfbc726bf.mp3", "Trang watches films at the cinema at weekends.": "audio/cau/58771fac6bb56dc4.mp3", "My brother likes to watch football, and he watches it every Sunday.": "audio/cau/b5419c83106d199e.mp3", "Can I have some water, please?": "audio/cau/e7f9c90ffdf43ef9.mp3", "Hoa waters the plants with rainwater.": "audio/cau/63d57a63a01495bc.mp3", "I felt weak after being ill.": "audio/cau/03f5f5db8d630661.mp3", "He is weak at Maths.": "audio/cau/c35e774616850489.mp3", "I play football twice a week.": "audio/cau/f42675610892504d.mp3", "Every week we have a weekly test.": "audio/cau/9b6cd05f35e45234.mp3", "I go to school on weekdays.": "audio/cau/9d7aaefa6fa649b1.mp3", "The museum is quiet on weekdays.": "audio/cau/eb912e589405ca96.mp3", "I visit my grandparents at the weekend.": "audio/cau/5f08fce8800a0ef9.mp3", "On weekdays I study, but at the weekend I relax.": "audio/cau/7161d9e546310ce2.mp3", "I made a weekly work list.": "audio/cau/43849226d993b20b.mp3", "We have a weekly English club on Fridays.": "audio/cau/c8606fc142f840df.mp3", "How much do you weigh?": "audio/cau/acb4bf07d5223766.mp3", "The shop assistant weighed the apples.": "audio/cau/4e7e5eaa540ad241.mp3", "If you eat too much fast food, you may put on more weight.": "audio/cau/2c99f39229f37ace.mp3", "Lan wants to lose weight, so she does more exercise.": "audio/cau/91285fa6cb6fd1e4.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "We went to the summer camp last June.": "audio/cau/577b7f143e454603.mp3", "Mi usually goes by bus, but yesterday she went by bike.": "audio/cau/bf4b0b541f770b47.mp3", "They were in Ha Noi last year.": "audio/cau/a884324b521a97cd.mp3", "I was at school, and my parents were at work.": "audio/cau/d6c97d0e9f2b3c05.mp3", "Where do you live, Lan?": "audio/cau/0c6d7d3df1a25694.mp3", "Where is my schoolbag, Mum?": "audio/cau/57a3c3d221996a0d.mp3", "Tuan tells a joke and the whole class laughs.": "audio/cau/72200be54ac56f1e.mp3", "We cleaned the whole house in one day.": "audio/cau/9e8c820037d2934c.mp3", "The new road is very wide.": "audio/cau/ca5d78940f527608.mp3", "The city will widen the narrow streets.": "audio/cau/73d72c9ffd031657.mp3", "English is widely spoken.": "audio/cau/e9a4f4da62f6ffdd.mp3", "This book is widely read in schools.": "audio/cau/9c5e8cb85b6a0c59.mp3", "The city plans to widen roads and build flyovers.": "audio/cau/350976526f3cce88.mp3", "This road is wide now because they widened it last year.": "audio/cau/f0b3c67484ac18ce.mp3", "The streets are wider than before.": "audio/cau/43e28d810d172739.mp3", "This road is wide, but that one is even wider.": "audio/cau/901cc573654e3536.mp3", "This is the widest road in the city.": "audio/cau/2d5e69bc8d62beb0.mp3", "The Amazon is one of the widest rivers.": "audio/cau/53f3d077ec10cc3b.mp3", "Measure the width of the table.": "audio/cau/61911ac7a0406d88.mp3", "The road is five metres in width.": "audio/cau/fb38cf72077a3c60.mp3", "Write the new word in your notebook.": "audio/cau/8b8bb3be1461f910.mp3", "This word has two syllables.": "audio/cau/3c07a10113a0df79.mp3", "Learn five new words every day.": "audio/cau/adb2b8f5372e6050.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures, one word for each picture.": "audio/cau/0c015f99a499421d.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "The worker wears a helmet.": "audio/cau/9c235c7e97cd46ce.mp3", "Factory workers work long hours.": "audio/cau/dd3d0d4cd13eb0b4.mp3", "My mum is working in the garden now.": "audio/cau/0fc0a939dbaf61f1.mp3", "Dad works hard, and today he is working late.": "audio/cau/8fff1884b3def435.mp3", "She was one of the most famous scientists in the world.": "audio/cau/60bcc9b6651e1a00.mp3", "Pho is famous all over the world.": "audio/cau/5cc0d2280fff73e9.mp3", "Their products are sold worldwide.": "audio/cau/33dc1c140e6b7e3c.mp3", "This game is popular all over the world.": "audio/cau/6841bcd23e5d5707.mp3", "The traffic is getting worse.": "audio/cau/b087dabc2647a0af.mp3", "My cold was bad yesterday, but today it is worse.": "audio/cau/17b44374c06cdd9f.mp3", "This is the worst film I've ever seen.": "audio/cau/2b6b7e86b637f5bc.mp3", "Monday is the worst day of the week for me.": "audio/cau/40b0df75c1307d68.mp3", "Please write your name here.": "audio/cau/a728b2e865ff5c76.mp3", "Mi likes to write, and she wrote a story yesterday.": "audio/cau/a907f42938059961.mp3", "My aunt is a writer.": "audio/cau/0b898dc7eb5824c9.mp3", "Mi wants to be a writer because she loves to write stories.": "audio/cau/5ce118b1d0da266b.mp3", "She was writing a book when I phoned her.": "audio/cau/97a3ce971a3a7562.mp3", "Mi is writing a letter, and she wrote one yesterday too.": "audio/cau/f5189e5fac049044.mp3", "This book was written by Nguyen Nhat Anh.": "audio/cau/51ab5fb359070a7c.mp3", "Have you written your essay yet?": "audio/cau/f3413694d52452f3.mp3", "Lan's answer was wrong, so she tried again.": "audio/cau/1b25a01594f7e8c8.mp3", "You look sad, Minh. What's wrong?": "audio/cau/bde31146d26c8a31.mp3", "He spelled my name wrongly.": "audio/cau/6f375b9c1ad0fc97.mp3", "She was wrongly blamed for the mistake.": "audio/cau/5c429e62a8f6c2c9.mp3", "He wrote many songs about Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/276b0567367fb73f.mp3", "Hoa wrote a letter, and she often writes to her grandma.": "audio/cau/a4131d3a1fc44e80.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3", "There are twelve months in a year.": "audio/cau/5ae786ad7493bc72.mp3", "This year, Mi is in Grade 9.": "audio/cau/6bad90fc27f44b2c.mp3", "The school has a yearly sports day.": "audio/cau/750d62eaf703f585.mp3", "We have a yearly health check.": "audio/cau/4c5595be96ba759a.mp3", "My sister is twelve years old.": "audio/cau/28db75637c65c4ff.mp3", "He worked there for five years before he moved to Hue.": "audio/cau/eee3be2c2ba96ad1.mp3", "My bedroom has yellow walls.": "audio/cau/019a89d25dcece1e.mp3", "The flowers are yellow, and the leaves are green.": "audio/cau/3d174fb5e38ecf01.mp3"};
